"If a devotee offers Me with devotion a little leaf, a flower, fruit or water, I shall accept it." Why does the Lord say this? Is He dependent on the offering of the devotee? He is not actually dependent, but He likes to be dependent u
pon His devotee. This is His mercy. Similarly, He does not fear the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 asuras.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Thus there is no question of partiality in the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
