\cs3000\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid16347101  My dear King, you have put before me an excellent question. Discourses concerning the a
ctivities of the Lord, in which the glories of His devotees are also found, are extremely pleasing to devotees. Such wonderful topics always counteract the miseries of the materialistic way of life. Therefore great sages like N\'e4rada always speak upon 
\'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam because it gives one the facility to hear and chant about the wonderful activities of the Lord. Let me offer my respectful obeisances unto \'c7r\'e9la Vy\'e4
sadeva and then begin describing topics concerning the activities of Lord Hari.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
