sa. One must first offer one's respectful obeisances to one's spiritual master. \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9's spiritual master is his father, Vy\'e4sadeva, and therefore he first offers his respectful obeisances to K\'e5\'f1\'eba Dvaip\'e4yana Vy\'e4
