}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  a fool. When one can properly understand the truth, one becomes devoted and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nirgu\'eba,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
