When the Supreme Personality of Godhead creates different types of bodies, offering a particular body to each living entity according to his character and fruitive actions, the Lord revives all the qualities of material nature\emdash sattva-gu\'eb
a, rajo-gu\'eba and tamo-gu\'eba. Then, as the Supersoul, He enters each body and influences the qualities of creation, maintenance and annihilation, using sattva-gu\'eba for maintenance, rajo-gu\'eba for creation and tamo-gu\'eba for annihilation.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
