\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sattva-gu\'eba, rajo-gu\'eba}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tamo-gu\'eba}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 \emdash nature is not independent. 
As the Lord says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (9.10):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 may\'e4dhyak\'f1e\'eba prak\'e5ti\'f9\line s\'fcyate sa-car\'e4caram\line hetun\'e4
