\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "This material nature is working under My direction, O son of Kunt\'e9
, and it is producing all moving and unmoving beings. By its rule this manifestation is created and annihilated again and again." The different changes in the material world take place as actions and reactions of the three }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 gu\'ebas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  but above the three }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 gu\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is their director, the Supreme Personality of Godhead. In the va
rious types of bodies given to the living entities by material nature (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yantr\'e4r\'fc\'f2h\'e4ni m\'e4yay\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ), either }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sattva-gu\'eba, rajo-gu\'eba}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tamo-gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is prominent. The body is produced by material nature according to the direction of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Therefore it is said here, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yad\'e4 sis\'e5k\'f1u\'f9 pura \'e4tmana\'f9 para\'f9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  indicating that the body is certainly created by the Lord. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Karma\'eb\'e4 daiva-netre\'eba:}{
\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 according to the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 karma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  of the living entity, a body is prepared under the Supreme Lord's supervision. Whether the body is of }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sattva-gu\'eba, rajo-gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tamo-gu\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 everything is done by the direction of the Supreme Lord through the agency of the external energy (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 p\'e5thak sva-m\'e4yay\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). In this way, in different types of bodies, the Lord (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e9\'e7vara}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ) gives directions as Param\'e4tm\'e4, and again, to destroy the body, He employs the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tamo-gu\'eba.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 This is the way the living entities receive different types of bodies.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.1.11
