\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash for the material energy; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 pumbhy\'e4m}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash and the living entity; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 nara-deva}{
\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash O ruler of men; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 satya}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash true; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 k\'e5t}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash 
creator.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s2998\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid16347101 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 
O great King, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, the controller of the material and spiritual energies, who is certainly the creator of the entire cosmos, creates the time factor to allow the material energy and the l
iving entity to act within the limits of time. Thus the Supreme Personality is never under the time factor nor under the material energy.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s3008\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14425756 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 
One should not think that the Lord is dependent on the time factor. He actually creates the situation by which
 material nature acts and by which the conditioned soul is placed under material nature. Both the conditioned soul and the material nature act within the time factor, but the Lord is not subject to the actions and reactions of time, for time has been crea
ted by Him. To be more clear, \'c7r\'e9la Vi\'e7van\'e4tha Cakravart\'e9 \'d6h\'e4kura says that creation, maintenance and annihilation are all under the supreme will of the Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 In }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  (4.7) the Lord says:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yad\'e4 yad\'e4 hi dharmasya\line gl\'e4nir bhavati bh\'e4rata\line abhyutth\'e4nam a
dharmasya\line tad\'e4tm\'e4na\'e0 s\'e5j\'e4my aham
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "Whenever and wherever there is a decline in religious practice, O descendant of Bh\'e4
rata, and a predominant rise of irreligion\emdash at that time I descend Myself." Since K\'e5\'f1\'eba, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, is the controller of everything, when He appears He is not within the limitations of material time (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 janma karma ca me divyam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). In this verse the words }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 k\'e4la\'e0 caranta\'e0 s\'e5jat\'e9\'e7a \'e4\'e7rayam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 indicate that although the Lord acts within time, whether }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sattva-gu\'eba, rajo-gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tamo-gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 is prominent, one should not think that the Lord is under time's control. Time is within His control, for He creates time to act in a certain way; He is not working under the control of time. The creation of the material world is one of the Lord's pa
stimes. Everything is fully under His control. Since creation takes place when }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 rajo-gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is prominent, the Lord creates the necessary time to give facilities for }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 rajo-gu\'eba.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Similarly, He also creates the necessary times for maintenance and annihilation. Thus this verse establishes that the Lord is not under the limitations of time.
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11471083 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 As stated in the }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 Brahma-sa\'e0
hit\'e4, \'e9\'e7vara\'f9 parama\'f9 k\'e5\'f1\'eba\'f9:}{\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the supreme controller. }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 Sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha\'f9:}{\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 He possesses a blissful, spiritual body. }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 An\'e4di\'f9:}{\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  He is not subordinate to anything. As the Lord confirms in }{\cs2542\i\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  (7.7), }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 matta\'f9 paratara\'e0 n\'e4nyat ki\'efcid asti dhana\'efjaya:}{\insrsid30033  "O conqueror of wealth [Arjuna], there is no truth superior to Me." Nothing can be above K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, for He is the controller and creator of everything.
\par The M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9 philosophers say that this material world is }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 mithy\'e4,}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  false, and that one should therefore not bother about this }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 mithy\'e4}{
\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  creation (}{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 brahma satya\'e0 jagan mithy\'e4}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 ). But this is not correct. Here it is said, }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 satya-k\'e5t:}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 whatever is created by the Supreme Personality of Godhead, }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 satya\'e0 param,}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  cannot be called }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 mithy\'e4.}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  The cause of the creation is }{
\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 satya,}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  true, so how can the effect of the cause be }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 mithy\'e4}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 ? The very word }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 satya-k\'e5t}{
\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  is used to establish that everything created by the Lord is factual, never false. The creation may be temporary, but it is not false.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.1.12
\par }\pard\plain \s2997\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11368625 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 TEXT 12
\par }\pard\plain \s1168\qr \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 TEXT
