gy according to the direction of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The conditioned soul, being seated on this machine, wanders throughout the universe, and because of his bodily conception of life he only suffers. Actually the suffering of being blasphe
med and the enjoyment of being praised, the acceptance of a good welcome or of chastisement by harsh words, are felt in the material conception of life; but since the body of the Supreme Personality of Godhead is not material but }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  He 
