u through one's mind, words or actions, for a blasphemer will go to hellish life along with his forefathers.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 karma\'eb\'e4 manas\'e4 v\'e4c\'e4\line yo dvi\'f1y\'e4d vi\'f1\'ebum avyayam\line 
