n, however, that the enemies of K\'e5\'f1\'eba are more elevated than K\'e5\'f1\'eba's pure devotees. In the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Caitanya-carit\'e4m\'e5ta}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
\'c4di}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  5.205) K\'e5\'f1\'ebad\'e4sa Kavir\'e4ja Gosv\'e4m\'e9 also thinks of himself in such a humble way:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 jag\'e4i m\'e4dh\'e4i haite mu\'efi se p\'e4pi\'f1\'f6ha\line pur\'e9\'f1era k\'e9\'f6
