\'e4dh\'e4r\'e4\'eb\'e9 thinks that the devotee is greater than She. Thus N\'e4rada Muni says that according to his opinion the enemies of K\'e5\'f1\'eba are better situated because they are fully absorbed in thoughts of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a in terms of killing Him, just as a very lusty man always thinks of women and their association.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
