\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  which is exhibited in V\'e5nd\'e4vana. Whether in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 d\'e4sya-rasa, sakhya-rasa, v\'e4tsalya-rasa}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  or }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 m\'e4dhurya-rasa,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  all the devotees of K\'e5\'f1\'eba are always overwhelmed by thoughts of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. When K\'e5\'f1\'eba is away from V\'e5nd\'e4
vana tending the cows in the forest, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 gop\'e9s,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  in the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 m\'e4dhurya-rasa,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 are always absorbed in thoughts of how K\'e5\'f1\'eba walks in the forest. The soles of His feet are so soft that the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 gop\'e9s}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 would not dare keep His lotus feet on their soft breasts. Indeed, they consider their breasts a very hard place for the lotus feet of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, yet those lotus feet wander in the forest, which is full of thorny plants. The }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 gop\'e9s}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  are absorbed in such thoughts at home, although K\'e5\'f1\'eba is away from them. Similarly, when K\'e5\'f1\'eba plays with His young friends, mother Ya\'e7od\'e4
 is very much disturbed by thoughts that K\'e5\'f1\'eba, because of always playing and not taking His food properly, must be getting weak. These are examples of the exalted ecstasy felt in K\'e5\'f1\'eba's service as manifested in V\'e5nd\'e4
vana. This service is indirectly praised by N\'e4rada Muni in this verse. Especially for the conditioned soul, N\'e4rada Muni recommends that one somehow or other be absorbed in thoughts of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, for that will save one from all the dangers of material existence. Full absorption in thought of K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the highest platform of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakti-yoga.
