\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  at V\'e5nd\'e4vana expressed their lusty desires in relationship with a paramour (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 parak\'e9ya-rasa}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
