by the enemies; }{\i\insrsid30033\charrsid5202404 gh\'e4tita\'f9}{\insrsid30033 \emdash killed; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 k\'f1udrai\'f9}{\insrsid30033 \emdash insignificant in power; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 bhr\'e4t\'e4}{\insrsid30033 \emdash brother; }{
\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 me}{\insrsid30033 \emdash my; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 dayita\'f9}{\insrsid30033 \emdash very dear; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 suh\'e5t}{\insrsid30033 \emdash well-wisher; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 p\'e4r\'f1\'ebi-gr\'e4he\'eba}{
\insrsid30033 \emdash attacking from the rear; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 hari\'eb\'e4}{\insrsid30033 \emdash by the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 samena}{\insrsid30033 \emdash equal to everyone (both the demigods and demons); }{
\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 api}{\insrsid30033 \emdash although; }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 upadh\'e4vanai\'f9}{\insrsid30033 \emdash by the worshipers, the demigods.
\par }\pard\plain \s3011\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5202404 \f63\fs24\cf27\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5202404\charrsid5202404 *}{\fs20\insrsid5202404\charrsid4525801 
Both the demons and demigods understand the Supreme Personality of Godhead to be the supreme master, but
 the demigods follow the master whereas the demons defy Him. Thus the demigods and demons are compared to the two co-wives of one husband. Each wife is the }{\i\fs20\insrsid5202404\charrsid4525801 sapatn\'e9}{\fs20\insrsid5202404\charrsid4525801 
 (co-wife) of the other, and therefore the word }{\i\fs20\insrsid5202404\charrsid4525801 sapatnai\'f9}{\fs20\insrsid5202404\charrsid4525801  is used here.}{\insrsid5202404\charrsid5202404 
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s2998\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid16347101 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 My insign
ificant enemies the demigods have combined to kill my very dear and obedient well-wisher, my brother Hira\'eby\'e4k\'f1a. Although the Supreme Lord, Vi\'f1\'ebu, is always equal to both of us\emdash namely, the demigods and the demons\emdash 
this time, being devoutly worshiped by the demigods, He has taken their side and helped them kill Hira\'eby\'e4k\'f1a.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 As stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (9.29), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 samo 'ha\'e0 sarva-bh\'fcte\'f1u:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 the Lord is equal to all living entities. Since the demigods and demons are both living entities, how is it possible that
 the Lord was partial to one class of living beings and opposed to another? Actually it is not possible for the Lord to be partial. Nonetheless, since the demigods, the devotees, always strictly follow the Supreme Lord's orders, because of sincerity they 
are victorious over the demons, who know that the Supreme Lord is Vi\'f1\'ebu but do not follow His instructions. Because of constantly remembering the Supreme Personality of Godhead, Vi\'f1\'ebu, the demons generally attain }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 s\'e4yujya-mukti}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  after death. The demon Hira\'ebyaka\'e7
ipu accused the Lord of being partial because the demigods worshiped Him, but in fact the Lord, like the government, is not partial at all. The government is not partial to any citizen, but if a citizen is law-abiding he receives abundant opportunities 
from the state laws to live peacefully and fulfill his real interests.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.2.7, SB 7.2.8, SB 7.2.7-8
