to the planet earth; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 y\'fcyam}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash all of you; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 brahma-k\'f1atra}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash of the }{
