\'e4dhy\'e4ya}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash study of Vedic knowledge; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vrata}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash the regulative vows; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 d\'e4nina\'f9}{
