 understand the fixed position of the spirit soul and how he is carried away by the waves of material nature to different bodies and different situations under lamentation and hankering. One achieves the success of life when he understands the constitutio
nal position of his self and is undisturbed by the conditions created by material nature (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 prak\'e5te\'f9 kriyam\'e4\'eb\'e4ni gu\'ebai\'f9 karm\'e4\'ebi sarva\'e7a\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ).
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.2.24
