." Although Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu was a great demon, he was not as foolish as the population of the modern world. Hira\'ebyaka\'e7
ipu had clear knowledge of the spirit soul and the subtle and gross bodies, but now we are so degraded that everyone, including the exalted scientists, philosophers and other leaders, is under the bodily conception of life, which is condemned in the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'e4stras.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Sa eva go-khara\'f9:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 such persons are nothing but cows and asses.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 Hira\'ebyaka\'e7
ipu advised his family members that although the gross body of his brother Hira\'eby\'e4k\'f1a was dead and they were aggrieved because of this, they should not lament for the great soul of Hira\'eby\'e4k\'f1
a, who had already attained his next destination. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c4tm\'e4,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  the spirit soul, is always unchanged (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 avikala\'f9 pum\'e4n}{
