eady left his body has been pious, Yamar\'e4ja, just to give him relief, will give him another body. Since the living being in the body of the King had some attachment to his body, he was hovering as a ghost, and therefore Yamar\'e4
ja, as a special consideration, approached the lamenting relatives to instruct them personally. Yamar\'e4
ja approached them as a child because a child is not restricted but is granted admittance anywhere, even to the palace of a king. Besides this, the child was speaking philosophy. People
