In the body the most important substance is the life air, but that also is neither the listener nor the speaker. Beyond even the life air, the soul also can do nothing, for the Supersoul is actually the director, 
in cooperation with the individual soul. The Supersoul conducting the activities of the body is different from the body and living force.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 The Supreme Personality of Godhead distinctly says in }{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (15.15), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sarvasya c\'e4ha\'e0 h\'e5di sannivi\'f1\'f6o matta\'f9 sm\'e5tir j\'ef\'e4nam apohana\'e0 ca:}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  "I am seated in everyone's heart, and from Me come remembrance, knowledge and forgetfulness." Although the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4tm\'e4,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 or soul, is present in every material body (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dehino 'smin yath\'e4 dehe}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 ), he is not actually the chief person actin
g through the senses, mind and so on. The soul can merely act in cooperation with the Supersoul because it is the Supersoul who gives him directions to act or not to act (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 matta\'f9 sm\'e5tir j\'ef\'e4nam apohana\'e0 ca}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 ). One cannot act without His sanction, for the Supersoul is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 upadra\'f1\'f6\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 anumant
\'e4,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 the witness and sanctioner. One who studies carefully, under the direction of a bona fide spiritual master, can understand the real knowledge that the Supreme Personality of Godhead is actually the conductor of all the activ
ities of the individual soul, and the controller of their results as well. Although the individual soul possesses the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 indriyas,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 or senses, he is not actually the proprietor, for the proprietor is the Supersoul. Consequently the Supersoul is called H\'e5\'f1\'e9ke\'e7a, and the individual soul is advised by the direction of the Supersoul to surrender to Him and thus be happy (}{
\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sarva}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 -dharm\'e4n parityajya m\'e4m eka\'e0 \'e7ara\'eba\'e0 vraja}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
). Thus he can become immortal and be transferred to the spiritual kingdom, where he will achieve t
he highest success of an eternal, blissful life of knowledge. In conclusion, the individual soul is different from the body, senses, living force and the airs within the body, and above him is the Supersoul, who gives the individual soul all facilities. T
he individual soul who renders everything to the Supersoul lives very happily within the body.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.2.46
