\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhajati}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash achieves; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 uts\'e5jati}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash gives up; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 hi}{
