The conditioned soul has knowledge, and if he wants to fully utilize the gross and subtle bodies for his real advancement in life, he can do so. It is therefore said here that by his high intelligence (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 svena tejas\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 ), by the superior power of superior knowledge achieved from the right source\emdash the spiritual master, or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4c\'e4rya}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
\emdash he can give up his conditional life in a material body and return home, back to Godhead. However, if he wants to keep himself in the darkness of this material world, he can do so. The Lord confirms this as follows in }{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (9.25):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 y\'e4nti deva-vrat\'e4 dev\'e4n\line pit\'e8n y\'e4nti pit\'e5-vrat\'e4\'f9\line bh\'fct
\'e4ni y\'e4nti bh\'fctejy\'e4\line y\'e4nti mad-y\'e4jino 'pi m\'e4m
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "Those who worship the dem
igods will take birth among the demigods; those who worship ghosts and spirits will take birth among such beings; those who worship ancestors go to the ancestors; and those who worship Me will live with Me."
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 The human form of body is valuable. One can use 
this body to go to the higher planetary systems, to Pit\'e5
loka, or he can remain in this lower planetary system, but if one tries he can also return home, back to Godhead. This prowess is given by the Supreme Personality of Godhead as the Supersoul. Therefore the Lord says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
matta\'f9 sm\'e5tir j\'ef\'e4nam apohana\'e0 ca:}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 "From Me come remembrance, knowledge and forgetfulness." If one wants to receive real knowledge from the Supreme Personality of Godhead, one can become free from bondage to repeated acceptance of material 
bodies. If one takes to the devotional service of the Lord and surrenders unto Him, the Lord is prepared to give one directions by which to return home, back to Godhead, but if one foolishly wants to keep himself in darkness, he can continue in a life of 
material existence.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.2.47
