\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash without old age or disease; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 amaram}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash immortal; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4tm\'e4nam}{
