, your position within this universe is certainly most auspicious for everyone, especially the cows and br\'e4hma\'ebas. Brahminical culture and the protection of cows can 
be increasingly glorified, and thus all kinds of material happiness, opulence and good fortune will automatically increase. But unfortunately, if Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu occupies your seat, everything will be lost.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 In this verse the words }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dvija-gav
\'e4\'e0 p\'e4rame\'f1\'f6hyam}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  indicate the most exalted position of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'ebas,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 brahminical culture and the cows. In Vedic culture, the welfare of the cows and the welfare of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 are essential. Without a proper arrangement for developing brahminical culture and protecting cows, all the affairs of administration will go to hell. Being afraid that Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu would occupy the post of Brahm\'e4
, all the demigods were extremely disturbed. Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu was a well-known demon, and the demigods knew that if demons and R\'e4k\'f1as
as were to occupy the supreme post, brahminical culture and protection of cows would come to an end. As stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 (5.29), the original proprietor of everything is Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhokt\'e4ra\'e0 yaj\'efa-tapas\'e4\'e0 sarva-loka-mahe\'e7varam}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 ). The Lord, therefore
, knows particularly well how to develop the material condition of the living entities within this material world. In every universe there is one Brahm\'e4 engaged on behalf of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba, as confirmed in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c7r
\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tene brahma h\'e5daya \'e4di-kavaye}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 ). The principal creator in each }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahm\'e4\'eb\'f2a}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  is Lord Brahm\'e4, who imparts Vedic knowledge to his disciples and sons. On every planet, the king or supreme controller must be a representative of Brahm
\'e4. Therefore, if a R\'e4k\'f1asa, or demon, were situated in Brahm\'e4's pos
t, then the entire arrangement of the universe, especially the protection of the brahminical culture and cows, would be ruined. All the demigods anticipated this danger, and therefore they went to request Lord Brahm\'e4
 to take immediate steps to thwart Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu's plan.
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11471083 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 In the beginning of creation, Lord Brahm\'e4
 was attacked by two demons\emdash Madhu and Kai\'f6abha\emdash but K\'e5\'f1\'eba saved him. Therefore K\'e5\'f1\'eba is addressed as }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 madhu-kai\'f6abha-hant\'e5.}{\insrsid30033  Now again, Hira\'ebyaka\'e7
ipu was trying to replace Brahm\'e4. The material world is so situated that even the position of Lord Brahm\'e4, not to speak of ordinary living entities, is sometimes in danger. Nonetheless, until the time of Hira\'ebyaka\'e7
ipu, no one had tried to replace Lord Brahm\'e4. Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu, however, was such a great demon that he maintained this ambition.
\par The word }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 bh\'fctyai}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  means "for increasing opulence," and the word }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 \'e7reyase}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 refers to ultimately returning home, back to Godhead. In spiritual advancement, one's material position improves at the same time that the path of liberati
on becomes clear and one is freed from material bondage. If one is situated in an opulent position in spiritual advancement, his opulence never decreases. Therefore such a spiritual benediction is called }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 bh\'fcti}{
\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  or }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 vibh\'fcti.}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  K\'e5\'f1\'eba confirms this in }{\cs2542\i\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  (10.41). }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 
Yad yad vibh\'fctimat sattva\'e0.}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 .. mama tejo-'\'e0\'e7a-sambhavam:}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 if a devotee advances in spiritual consciousness and thus becomes materially opulent also, his position is a special gift from the Lord. Such opulence is never to be considered material. 
At the present, especially on this planet earth, the influence of Lord Brahm\'e4 has decreased considerably, and the representatives of Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu\emdash the R\'e4k\'f1asas and demons\emdash 
have taken charge. Therefore there is no protection of brahminical culture and cows, which are the basic prerequisites for all kinds of good fortune. This age is very dangerous because society is being managed by demons and R\'e4k\'f1asas.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.3.14
