ed that the original source of everything is life. Brahm\'e4 was instructed by the supreme life, K\'e5\'f1\'eba. K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the supreme living entity (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nityo nity\'e4n\'e4\'e0 cetana\'e7 cetan\'e4n\'e4m}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 ), and Brahm\'e4 is also a living entity, but the original source of Brahm\'e4 is K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Therefore K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (7.7), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 matta\'f9 paratara\'e0 n\'e4nyat ki\'efcid asti dhana\'efjaya:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  "O Arjuna, there is no truth superior to Me." K\'e5
\'f1\'eba is the original source of Brahm\'e4, who is the original source of this universe. Brahm\'e4 is a representative of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, and therefore all the qualities and activities of K\'e5\'f1\'eba are also present in Lord Brahm\'e4.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.3.30
