oma. Indeed, you inspire the yaj\'efic br\'e4hma\'ebas to perform the rituals mentioned in the three Vedas. Being the Supreme Soul, the Supersoul of all living entities, you are beginningless, endless and omniscient, beyond the limits of time and space.

