ads, and from all the sub-limbs of the original Vedic knowledge, form your external body. You are Hira\'ebyagarbha, the reservoir of the universe, but nonetheless, being situated as the supreme controller, you are transcenden
tal to the material world, which consists of the three modes of material nature.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
