e living entities, both moving and nonmoving, are controlled by the Vedic instructions in art and science, and therefore they are all expansions of the external energy of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is the center as the Supersoul. The }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahm\'e4\'eb\'f2as,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  the universes, exist during the duration of a breath of the Supreme Lord (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yasyaika-ni\'e7vasita-k\'e4lam ath\'e4
