\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 . Nothing, therefore, is separate from the Supreme Lord. This is the philosophy of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 acintya-bhed\'e4bheda-tattva.
