ipu was so alert against being burnt to ashes by the anger of great sages like Bh\'e5gu that by dint of a
usterity he surpassed their power and placed even them under his subordination. It appears that even in the higher planetary systems, to which people are promoted by pious activities, disturbances are created by }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 asuras}{
