\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  the Lord says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakty\'e4 m\'e4m abhij\'e4n\'e4ti.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
