\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  In }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakti}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  there are nine different activities: }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtana\'e0 vi\'f1\'eb
