s, for example, are described in this way: }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dh\'e9r\'e4dh\'e9ra jana-priyau.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  They were popular with both the gentle and the ruffians. A Vai\'f1\'eb
