a, the supreme planet, and thus he could not think of the material world and live without K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. That is the sign of a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mah\'e4-bh\'e4gavata.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Even if one is an enemy of K\'e5
