ghs and becomes jubilant. Similarly, Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, being always absorbed in thoughts of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, sometimes felt separation, thinking, "Where is K\'e5\'f1\'eba?" This is explained by \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu. }{
