\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (3.25.25), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sat\'e4\'e0 prasa\'ecg\'e4n mama v\'e9rya-sa\'e0vido bhavanti h\'e5t-kar\'eba-ras\'e4yan\'e4\'f9 kath
\'e4\'f9:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  only by association with devotees can one authoritatively understand the position of the Lord and His devotees. A devotee like N\'e4rada Muni is addressed as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
suvrata.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Su}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  means "good," and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vrata}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
