\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (18.55), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakty\'e4 m\'e4m abhij\'e4n\'e4ti:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  one must try to understand K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a by devotional service and from a devotee. Therefore Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira Mah\'e4r\'e4ja was quite right in wanting to learn further about Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja from \'c7r\'e9 N\'e4rada Muni.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.4.45
