ja, of course, being a perfect devotee, knew everything and could say what the best part of life is. In the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vedas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  it is said, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yasmin vij
