\'e4ja, therefore, knew the best of knowledge, and when his father inquired from him, Prahl\'e4da gave him that knowledge. Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja was able to solve the most difficult parts of problems because of his advanced K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness. Therefore he replied as follows.
