of persons who have accepted the material body; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sad\'e4}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash always; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 samudvigna}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash 
full of anxieties; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 dhiy\'e4m}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash whose intelligence; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 asat-grah\'e4t}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash 
because of accepting the temporary body or bodily relations as real (thinking "I am this body, and everything belonging to this body is mine"); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 hitv\'e4}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash giving up; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4tma-p\'e4tam}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash the place where spiritual culture or self-realization is stopped; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 g\'e5ham}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash 
