\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash which; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 harim}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4\'e7rayeta}{
\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash may take shelter of.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3002\fs28\cf9\insrsid30033\charrsid16347101 Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja replied:}{
\cs3000\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid16347101  O best of the asuras, King of the demons, as far as I have learned 
from my spiritual master, any person who has accepted a temporary body and temporary household life is certainly embarrassed by anxiety because of having fallen in a dark well where there is no water but only suffering. One should give up this position an
d go to the forest [vana]. More clearly, one should go to V\'e5nd\'e4vana, where only K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness is prevalent, and should thus take shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s3008\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14425756 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu thought that Prahl\'e4da, being nothing but a small boy 
with no actual experience, might reply with something pleasing but nothing practical. Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, however, being an exalted devotee, had acquired all the qualities of education.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yasy\'e4sti bhaktir bhagavaty aki\'efcan\'e4\line sarvair gu\'ebais tatra sam\'e4sate sur
\'e4\'f9\line har\'e4v abhaktasya kuto mahad-gu\'eb\'e4\line manorathen\'e4sati dh\'e4vato bahi\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "One who has unflinching devotional faith in K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consistently manifests all the good qualities of K\'e5\'f1\'eba and the demigods. However, he who has no devotion to the Supreme Personality of Godhea
d has no good qualifications because he is engaged by mental concoction in material existence, which is the external feature of the Lord." }{\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid5139582\charrsid5139582 (Bh\'e4g.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 5.18.12) So-called educated philosophers and scientists who are simply on the mental platform cannot distinguish between what is actually }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sat,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  eternal, and what is }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 asat,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  temporary. The Vedic injunction is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 asato m\'e4 jyotir gama:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 everyone should give up the platform of temporary existence and approach the eternal platform. The soul is eternal, and topics concerning the eternal soul are actually knowledge. Elsewhere it is said, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 apa\'e7yat\'e4m 
\'e4tma-tattva\'e0 g\'e5he\'f1u g\'e5ha-medhin\'e4m:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 those who are attached to the bodily conception of life and who thus stick to life as a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hastha,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or householder, on the platform of material sense enjoyment, cannot see the welfare of the eternal soul. Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja confirmed this by saying that if one wants success in life, he should immediately understand from the right sources what his self-interest is and how he should mold his life in spiritu
al consciousness. One should understand himself to be part and parcel of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a and thus completely take shelter of His lotus feet for guaranteed spiritual success. Everyone in the material world is in the bodily conception, struggling hard for existence, life after life. Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja therefore recommended that to stop this material condition of repeated birth and death, one should go to the forest (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vana}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ).
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 In the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama}{
\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  system, one first becomes a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahmac\'e4r\'e9,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  then a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hastha,}{
\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 v\'e4naprastha}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  and finally a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4s\'e9.}{
\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  Going to the forest means accepting }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 v\'e4naprastha}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  life, which is between }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hastha}{
\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  life and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4sa.}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  As confirmed in the }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vi\'f1\'ebu Pur\'e4\'eba}{
\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  (3.8.9), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eb\'e4\'e7ram\'e4c\'e4ravat\'e4 puru\'f1e\'eba para\'f9 pum\'e4n vi\'f1\'ebur \'e4r\'e4dhyate:}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 by accepting the institution of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eba}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4\'e7rama,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 one can very easily elevate himself to the platform of worshiping Vi\'f1\'ebu, the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Otherwise, if one remains in the bodily conception, one must rot within this material world, and his life will be a failure. Society must h
ave divisions of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'eba, k\'f1atriya, vai\'e7ya}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'fcdra,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 and for spiritual advancement one must gradually develop as a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahmac\'e4r\'e9, g\'e5hastha, v\'e4naprastha}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4s\'e9.}{
\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja recommended that his father accept }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 v\'e4naprastha}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  life because as a }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hastha}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  he was becoming increasingly demoniac due to bodily attachment. Prahl\'e4da recommended to his father that accepting }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 v\'e4
naprastha}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  life would be better than going deeper and deeper into }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5ham andha-k\'fcpam,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  the blind well of life as a }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hastha.}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  In our K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement we therefore invite all the elderly persons of the world to come to V\'e5nd\'e4
vana and stay there in retired life, making advancement in spiritual consciousness, K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness.
