\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "The humble sage, by virtue of true knowledge, sees with equal vision a learned and gentle }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  a cow, an elephant, a dog and a dog-eater [outcaste]." }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1128804 P}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 a\'eb\'f2it\'e4\'f9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  those
 who are actually learned\emdash the equipoised, advanced devotees who have full knowledge of everything\emdash do not see any living entity as an enemy or friend. Instead, with broader vision, they see that everyone is part of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, as confirmed by \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 j\'e9vera 'svar\'fcpa' haya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid1128804 \emdash }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 k\'e5\'f1\'ebera 'nitya-d\'e4sa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
'). Every living entity, being part of the Supreme Lord, is meant to serve the Lord, just as every part of the body is meant to serve the whole body.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 As servants of the Supreme Lord, all living entities are on
e, but a Vai\'f1\'ebava, because of his natural humility, addresses every other living entity as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 prabhu.}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  A Vai\'f1\'eb
ava sees other servants to be so advanced that he has much to learn from them. Thus he accepts all other devotees of the Lord as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 prabhus,}{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  masters. Alt
hough everyone is a servant of the Lord, one Vai\'f1\'ebava servant, because of humility, sees another servant as his master. Understanding of the master begins from understanding of the spiritual master.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yasya pras\'e4d\'e4d bhagavat-pras\'e4do\line yasy\'e4pras\'e4d\'e4n na gati\'f9 kuto 'pi}{
