\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
For iron to be attracted by a magnet is natural. Similarly, for all living entities to be attracted toward K\'e5\'f1\'eba is natural, and therefore the Lord's real name is K\'e5\'f1\'eba, meaning He
 who attracts everyone and everything. The typical examples of such attraction are found in V\'e5nd\'e4vana, where everything and everyone is attracted by K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The elderly persons like Nanda Mah\'e4r\'e4ja and Ya\'e7od\'e4dev\'e9
, the friends like \'c7r\'e9d\'e4m\'e4, Sud\'e4m\'e4 and the other cowherd boys, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 gop\'e9s}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  like \'c7r\'e9mat\'e9 R\'e4dh\'e4r\'e4\'eb\'e9
 and Her associates, and even the birds, beasts, cows and calves are attracted. The flowers and fruits in the gardens are attracted, the waves of the Yamun\'e4 are attracted, and the land, sky, trees, plants, a
nimals and all other living beings are attracted by K\'e5\'f1\'eba. This is the natural situation of everything in V\'e5nd\'e4vana.
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11471083 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 Just contrary to the affairs of V\'e5nd\'e4
vana is the material world, where no one is attracted by K\'e5\'f1\'eba and everyone is attracted by }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\insrsid30033  This is the difference between the spiritual and material worlds. Hira\'ebyaka\'e7
ipu, who was in the material world, was attracted by women and money, whereas Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, being in his natural position, was attracted by K\'e5\'f1\'eba. In replying to Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu's question about why Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja had a deviant view, Prahl\'e4da said that his view was not deviant, for the natural position of everyone is to be attracted by K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu found this view deviant, Prahl\'e4da said, because of being unnaturally unattracted by K
\'e5\'f1\'eba. Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu therefore needed purification.
\par As soon as one is purified of material contamination, he is again attracted by K\'e5\'f1\'eba (}{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 sarvop\'e4dhi-vinirmukta\'e0 tat-paratvena nirmalam}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
). In the material world, everyone is contaminated by the dirt o
f sense gratification and is acting according to different designations, sometimes as a human being, sometimes a beast, sometimes a demigod or tree, and so on. One must be cleansed of all these designations. Then one will be naturally attracted to K\'e5
\'f1\'eba. The }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 bhakti}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  process purifies the living entity of all unnatural attractions. When one is purified he is attracted by K\'e5\'f1\'eba and begins to serve K\'e5\'f1\'eba instead of serving }
{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  This is his natural position. A devotee is attracted by K\'e5\'f1\'eba, whereas a nondevotee,
 being contaminated by the dirt of material enjoyment, is not. This is confirmed by the Lord in }{\cs2542\i\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  (7.28):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ye\'f1\'e4\'e0 tv anta-gata\'e0 p\'e4pa\'e0\line jan\'e4n\'e4\'e0 pu\'ebya-karma\'eb\'e4m
