al orders, pacification, the offer of a post, or, finally, weapons. When there are no other arguments, he is punished. In logic, this is called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 argumentum ad baculum.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 When the two seminal }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  \'d1a\'eb\'f2a and Amarka failed to extract from Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja 
