\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash by you; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vipak\'f1am}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash the party of my enemies; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e7rayat\'e4}{
