\par mitho 'bhipadyeta g\'e5ha-vrat\'e4n\'e4m
\par ad\'e4nta-gobhir vi\'e7at\'e4\'e0 tamisra\'e0
\par puna\'f9 puna\'e7 carvita-carva\'eb\'e4n\'e4m
\par }\pard\plain \s1146\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v\fs28\insrsid30033 SYNONYMS
\par }\pard\plain \s1140\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\cf9\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e7r\'e9-prahr\'e4da\'f9 uv\'e4ca}{
\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja said; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mati\'f9}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash inclination; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 na}{
\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash never; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 k\'e5\'f1\'ebe}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash unto Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 parata\'f9}{
\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash from the instructions of others; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 svata\'f9}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash from their own understanding; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 v\'e4}{
\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash either; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mitha\'f9}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash from combined effort; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 abhipadyeta}{
\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash is developed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 g\'e5ha-vrat\'e4n\'e4m}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash of persons too addicted to the materialistic, bodily conception of life; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ad\'e4nta}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash uncontrolled; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 gobhi\'f9}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash by the senses; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vi\'e7at\'e4m}
{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash entering; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tamisram}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash hellish life; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 puna\'f9}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 
\emdash again; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 puna\'f9}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash again; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 carvita}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash things already chewed; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 carva\'eb\'e4n\'e4m}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash who are chewing.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3002\fs28\cf9\insrsid30033\charrsid16347101 Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja replied:}{
\cs3000\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid16347101  Because of their uncontrolled senses, persons too addicted to materialistic life make progress toward hellish conditions and repeatedly chew that which has already been chewed. Their inclinations toward K\'e5
\'f1\'eba are never aroused, either by the instructions of others, by their own efforts, or by a combination of both.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 In this verse the words }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 matir na k
\'e5\'f1\'ebe}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  refer to devotional service rendered to K\'e5\'f1\'eba. So-called politicians, erudite scholars and philosophers who read }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  try to twist some meaning from it to suit their material purposes, but their misunderstandings of K\'e5\'f1\'eba will not yield them any profit. Because such politicians, philosophers and scholars are int
erested in using }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  as a vehicle for adjusting things materially, for them constant thought of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, or K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness, is impossible (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 matir na k\'e5\'f1\'ebe}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 ). As stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (18.55), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakty\'e4 m\'e4m abhij\'e4n\'e4ti:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  only through devotional service can one understand K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a as He is. The so-called politicians and scholars think of K\'e5\'f1\'eba as fictitious. The politician says that his K\'e5\'f1\'eba is different from the K\'e5\'f1\'eba depicted in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4.}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  Even though he accepts K\'e5\'f1\'eba and R\'e4ma as the Supreme he thinks of R\'e4ma and K\'e5\'f1\'eba as impersonal because he has no idea of service to K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Thus his only business is }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 puna\'f9 puna\'e7 carvita-carva\'eb\'e4n\'e4m}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 \emdash chewing the chewed again and again. The aim of such politicians and academic scholars is to enjoy this material world
 with their bodily senses. Therefore it is clearly stated here that those who are }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5ha-vrata,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 whose only aim is to live comfortably with the body in the material world, cannot understand K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The two expressions }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5ha-vrata}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  and }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 carvita-carva\'eb\'e4n\'e4m}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  indicate
 that a materialistic person tries to enjoy sense gratification in different bodily forms, life after life, but is still unsatisfied. In the name of personalism, this ism or that ism, such persons always remain attached to the materialistic way of life. A
s stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (2.44):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhogai\'e7varya-prasakt\'e4n\'e4\'e0\line tay\'e4pah\'e5ta-cetas\'e4m\line vyavas\'e4y\'e4
tmik\'e4 buddhi\'f9\line sam\'e4dhau na vidh\'e9yate
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
"In the minds of those who are too attached to sense enjoyment and material opulence, and who are bewildered by such things, the resol
ute determination for devotional service to the Supreme Lord does not take place." Those who are attached to material enjoyment cannot be fixed in devotional service to the Lord. They cannot understand Bhagav\'e4n, K\'e5\'f1\'eba, or His instruction, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Ad\'e4nta-gobhir vi\'e7at\'e4\'e0 tamisram:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
their path actually leads toward hellish life.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 As confirmed by \'c5\'f1abhadeva, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
mahat-sev\'e4\'e0 dv\'e4ram \'e4hur vimukte\'f9:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 one must try to understand K\'e5\'f1\'eba by serving a devotee. The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mahat}{
\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  refers to a devotee.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mah\'e4tm\'e4nas tu m\'e4\'e0 p\'e4rtha\line daiv\'e9\'e0 prak\'e5tim \'e4\'e7rit\'e4\'f9
\line bhajanty ananya-manaso\line j\'ef\'e4tv\'e4 bh\'fct\'e4dim avyayam
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "O son of P\'e5th\'e4
, those who are not deluded, the great souls, are under the protection of the divine nature. They are fully engaged in devotional service because they know Me as the Supreme Personality of Godhead, original and inexhaustible." (Bg. 9.13) A }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mah\'e4tm\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is one who is constantly engaged in devotional service, twenty-four hours a day. As explained in the following verses, unless one adheres to such a great personality, one cannot u
nderstand K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu wanted to know where Prahl\'e4da had gotten this K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. Who had taught him? Prahl\'e4da sarcastically replied, "My dear father, persons like you never understand K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. One can understand K\'e5\'f1\'eba only by serving a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mahat,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 a great soul. Those who try to adjust material conditions are said to be chewing the chewed. No one has been able to adjust material conditions, but life after life, generation after generation, people try and repeatedly fail. Unless one is properly trai
ned by a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mahat}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \emdash a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mah\'e4tm\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or unalloyed devotee of the Lord\emdash there is no possibility of one's understanding K\'e5\'f1
\'eba and His devotional service."
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.5.31
\par }\pard\plain \s2997\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11368625 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 TEXT 31
