tions. Then liberation from material bondage will be easier to attain. That is the Vedic process. When one is above the stages of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dharma, artha, k\'e4ma}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  and }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mok\'f1a,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  one becomes a devotee. He is then on the platform from which he is guaranteed not to fall again to material existence (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yad gatv
