\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vedas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  is to attain the perfect stage of devotional service in the human form of life. According to the Vedic system, therefore, from the very beginning of life the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahmacarya}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  system is introduced so that from one's very childhood\emdash from the age of five years\emdash one can practice modifying one's human activities so as to 
engage perfectly in devotional service. As confirmed in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  (2.40), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 svalpam apy asya dharmasya tr\'e4yate mahato bhay\'e4
t:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  "Even a little advancement on this path can protect one from the most dangerous type of fear." Modern civilization, not referrin
