 it teaches mothers to kill their children even in the womb, on the plea of curbing the increase of population. And i
f by chance a child is saved, he is educated only for sense gratification. Gradually, throughout the entire world, human society is losing interest in the perfection of life. Indeed, men are living like cats and dogs, spoiling the duration of their human 
lives by actually preparing to transmigrate again to the degraded species among the 8,400,000 forms of life. The K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement is anxious to serve human society by teaching people to perform devotional service, which can save a human being from being degraded again to animal life. As already stated by Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bh\'e4gavata-dharma}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  consists of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtana\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9 smara\'eba\'e0 p\'e4da-sevanam/ arcana\'e0 vandana\'e0 d
\'e4sya\'e0 sakhyam \'e4tma-nivedanam.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  In all the schools, colleges and universities, and 
at home, all children and youths should be taught to hear about the Supreme Personality of Godhead. In other words, they should be taught to hear the instructions of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  to put them into practice in their lives, and thus to become strong in devotional service, free from fear of being degraded to animal life. Following }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bh\'e4gavata-dharma}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  has been made extremely easy in this age of Kali. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'e4stra}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  says:
