"The sages, knowing Me as the ultimate purpose of all sacrifices and austerities, the Supreme Lord of all planets and demigods and the benefactor and well-wisher of all living entities, atta
ins peace from the pangs of material miseries." Simply by understanding these three facts\emdash that the Supreme Lord, Vi\'f1\'eb
u, is the proprietor of the entire creation, that He is the best well-wishing friend of all living entities, and that He is the supreme enjoyer of everything\emdash 
one becomes peaceful and happy. For this transcendental happiness, the living entity has wandered throughout the universe in different forms of life and different planetary systems, but because he has forgotten his intimate relationship with Vi\'f1\'eb
u, he has merely suffered, life after life. Therefore, the educational system in the human form of life should be so perfect that one will understand his intimate relationship with God, or Vi\'f1\'ebu. Every living entity has an intimate relationship wi
th God. One should therefore glorify the Lord in the adoration of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'e4nta-rasa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or revive his eternal relationship with Vi\'f1\'ebu as a servant in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 d\'e4
sya-rasa,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  a friend in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sakhya-rasa,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  a parent in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 v\'e4tsalya-rasa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or a conjugal lover in }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 m\'e4dhurya-rasa.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  All these relationships are on the platform of love. Vi\'f1\'eb
u is the center of love for everyone, and therefore the duty of everyone is to engage in the loving service of the Lord. As stated by the Supreme Personality of Godhead }{\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid5139582\charrsid5139582 (Bh\'e4g.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 3.25.38), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ye\'f1\'e4m aha\'e0 priya \'e4tm\'e4 suta\'e7 ca sakh\'e4 guru\'f9 suh\'e5do daivam i\'f1\'f6am.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  In any form of life, we are related with Vi\'f1\'eb
u, who is the most beloved, the Supersoul, son, friend and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 guru.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Our eternal relationship with God can be revived in the human form of life, and that should be the goal of educ
ation. Indeed, that is the perfection of life and the perfection of education.
