\par Human society should be divided into a social system of }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'ebas, k\'f1atriyas, vai\'e7yas}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  and }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 \'e7\'fcdras,}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
