\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  or one hundred years, are relatively different according to time, person and circumstances. As far as human beings are concerned, the calc
ulation given here is right for the general public. Although one has a maximum of one hundred years of life, by sleeping one loses fifty years. Eating, sleeping, sex life and fear are the four bodily necessities, but to utilize the full duration of life a
 person desiring to advance in spiritual consciousness must reduce these activities. That will give him an opportunity to fully use his lifetime.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.6.7
