hai\'f9}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash very strong; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 baddham}{\cs2996\fs28\insrsid30033\charrsid11368625 \emdash bound hand and foot; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 utsaheta}{
