, although you are sons of demons, keep aloof from such persons and take shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, the origin of all the demigods, because the ultimate goal for the devotees of N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a is liberation from the bondage of material existence.
