omen, they glide down to the darkest regions of material existence. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Ad\'e4nta-gobhir vi\'e7at\'e4\'e0 tamisra\'e0 puna\'f9 puna\'e7 carvita-carva\'eb\'e4n\'e4m.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 Because they are unable to control their senses, they continue a life of chewing the chewed and therefore descend to the dark
est material regions. One should give up the association of such demons and adhere to the association of devotees. Thus one will be able to be liberated from material bondage.
