\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
"One who engages in full devotional service, who does not fall down in any circumstance, at once transcends the modes of material nature and thus comes to the le
vel of Brahman." One who fully engages in the devotional service of the Lord is immediately raised to the transcendental position, which is the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahma-bh\'fcta}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 stage. Any education or activity not on the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahma-bh\'fcta}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  platform, the platform of self-realization, is considered to be material, and Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja says that anything material cannot be the Absolute Truth, for the Absolute Truth is on the spiritual platform. This is also confirmed by Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 (2.45), where He says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 traigu\'ebya-vi\'f1ay\'e4 ved\'e4 nistraigu\'ebyo bhav\'e4rjuna:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  "The }{\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid4553959 Vedas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 mainly deal with the subject of the three modes of material nature. Rise above these modes, O Arjuna. Be transcendental to all of them." To act on the material platform, even if one's activities are sanctioned by the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
Vedas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is not the ultimate goal of life. The ultimate goal of life is to stay on the spiritual platform, fully surrendered to the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 parama-puru\'f1a,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 the supreme person. This is the object of the human mission. In summary, the Vedic ritualistic ceremonies 
and injunctions are not to be discounted; they are means of being promoted to the spiritual platform. But if one does not come to the spiritual platform, the Vedic ceremonies are simply a waste of time. This is confirmed in }{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (1.2.8):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dharma\'f9 svanu\'f1\'f6hita\'f9 pu\'e0s\'e4\'e0\line vi\'f1vaksena-kath\'e4su ya\'f9\line 
notp\'e4dayed yadi rati\'e0\line \'e7rama eva hi kevalam
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "Duties [}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dharma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
