One can understand the Supreme Personality as He is only by devotional service. And when one is in full consciousness of the Supreme Lord by such devotion, he can enter into the kingdom of God." (Bg. 18.55)
\par }\pard\plain \s3005\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11471083 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 These are Vedic instructions. One must have full 
faith in the words of the spiritual master and similar faith in the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Then the real knowledge of }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 \'e4tm\'e4}{\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  and Param\'e4tm\'e4
 and the distinction between matter and spirit will be automatically revealed. This }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 \'e4tma-tattva,}{\cs3007\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  or spiritual k
nowledge, will be revealed within the core of a devotee's heart because of his having taken shelter of the lotus feet of a }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 mah\'e4jana}{\insrsid30033  such as Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja.
\par In this verse the word }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 bh\'fcy\'e4t}{\insrsid30033  may be understood to mean "let there be." Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja offers his blessings to his class friends, saying, "Also become faithful like me. Become bona fide Vai\'f1
\'ebavas." A devotee of the Lord desires for everyone to take to K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. Unfortunately, however, people sometimes do not have staunch faith in the wor
ds of the spiritual master who comes by the disciplic succession, and therefore they are unable to understand transcendental knowledge. The spiritual master must be in the line of authorized disciplic succession, like Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja, who received the knowledge from N\'e4rada. If the class friends of Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, the sons of demons, were to accept the truth through Prahl\'e4da, they would certainly also become fully aware of transcendental knowledge.
\par The words }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 vai\'e7\'e4rad\'e9 dh\'e9\'f9}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  refer to intelligence concerni
ng the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is extremely expert. The Lord has created wonderful universes by His expert knowledge. Unless one is extremely expert, he cannot understand the expert management of the supreme expert. One can understand, however
, if one is fortunate enough to meet a bona fide spiritual master coming in the disciplic succession from Lord Brahm\'e4, Lord \'c7iva, Mother Lak\'f1m\'e9 or the Kum\'e4ras. These four }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 samprad\'e4yas,}{
\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  or disciplic successions of knowledge and transcendence, are called the Brahma-samprad\'e4ya, Rudra-samprad\'e4ya, \'c7r\'e9-samprad\'e4ya, and Kum\'e4ra-samprad\'e4ya. }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 Samprad\'e4ya-vih\'e9n\'e4
 ye mantr\'e4s te ni\'f1phal\'e4 mat\'e4\'f9.}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083  The knowledge of the Supreme received from such a }{\cs1998\i\insrsid30033 samprad\'e4ya,}{\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 
 or disciplic succession, can give one enlightenment. If one does not ta
ke to the path of disciplic succession, it is not possible for one to understand the Supreme Personality of Godhead. If one understands the Supreme Lord through devotional service with faith in the disciplic succession and then advances further, he awaken
s his natural love for God, and then his success in life is assured.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.7.18
