\line +ae\}aezu dehezu TaQaaTMaYaaeGaE\'82\line  rDYaaTMaivd( b]\'f8GaiTa& l/>aeTa )) 21 ))
\par }\pard\plain \s23\qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 svar\'eba\'e0 yath\'e4 gr\'e4vasu hema-k\'e4ra\'f9
