\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash is rendered; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhakti\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash devotional service; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e9\'e7vare}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the supreme controller; }{
