\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756   One feels }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahma-sukha,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  spiritual happiness, by merging into the impersonal Brahman because the }{
