\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756   }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Yasya prabh\'e4,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  the impersonal Brahman, consists of the rays of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
