\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s2998\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid16347101 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 
O my friends, sons of the asuras, the Supreme Personality of Godhead in His Supersoul feature always exists within the cores of the hearts of all living entities. Indeed, He is the well-wisher and friend of all li
ving entities, and there is no difficulty in worshiping the Lord. Why, then, should people not engage in His devotional service? Why are they so addicted to unnecessarily producing artificial paraphernalia for sense gratification?
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 Because the Perso
nality of Godhead is supreme, no one is equal to Him, and no one is greater than Him. Nonetheless, if one is a devotee of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, the Lord is easily obtainable. The Lord is compared to the sky because the sky is vast yet within
 the reach of all, not only of human beings but even of the animals. The Supreme Lord, in His Param\'e4tm\'e4 feature, exists as the best well-wisher and friend. As confirmed in the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vedas, sayujau sakh\'e4yau.}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  The Lord, in His Supersoul feature, always stays in the 
heart along with the living entity. The Lord is so friendly to the living entity that He remains within the heart so that one can always contact Him without difficulty. One can do this simply by devotional service (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7
rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtana\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9 smarana\'e0}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid9240924 p\'e4da-sevanam}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
). As soon as one hears of the Supreme Personality of Godhead (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 k\'e5\'f1\'eba-k\'e9rtana}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
), one immediately comes in touch with the Lord. A devotee immediately comes in touch with the Lord by any or all of the items of devotional service:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtana\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9\line smara\'eba\'e0 p\'e4da-sevanam\line 
arcana\'e0 vandana\'e0 d\'e4sya\'e0\line sakhyam \'e4tma-nivedanam}{\i0\cf1\insrsid30033 
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Therefore there is no difficulty in coming in contact with the Supreme Lord (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ko 'ti-pray\'e4sa\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). On the other hand, going to hell requires great endeavor. If one wants to go to hell by illi
cit sex, meat-eating, gambling and intoxication, he must acquire so many things. For illicit sex he must arrange for money for brothels, for meat-eating he must arrange for many slaughterhouses, for gambling he must arrange for casinos and hotels, and for
 
intoxication he must open many breweries. Clearly, therefore, if one wants to go to hell he must endeavor very much, but if he wants to return home, back to Godhead, there is no difficult endeavor. To go back to Godhead, one may live alone anywhere, in an
y condition, and simply sit down, meditate upon the Supersoul and chant and hear about the Lord. Thus there is no difficulty in approaching the Lord. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Ad\'e4nta-gobhir vi\'e7at\'e4\'e0 tamisram.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 Because of inability to control the senses, one must go through great endeavor to go to hell, but if one is sensible he can very easily obtain the favor of the Supreme Personality of Godhead because the Lord is always with him. By the simple method of }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid11404234 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtana\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  the Lord is satisfied. Indeed, the Lord says:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 patra\'e0 pu\'f1pa\'e0 phala\'e0 toya\'e0\line yo me bhakty\'e4 prayacchati\line tad aha
\'e0 bhakty-upah\'e5tam\line a\'e7n\'e4mi prayat\'e4tmana\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
"If one offers Me with love and devotion a leaf, a flower, fruit or water, I will accept it." (Bg. 9.26) One can meditate upon the Lord anywhere and everywhere. Thus Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja advised his friends, the sons of the demons, to take this path back home, back to Godhead, without difficulty.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.7.39
