\par }\pard\plain \s2998\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid16347101 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 
It is learned from Vedic literature that by performing great sacrifices one may elevate himself to the heavenly planets. However, although life on the heavenly planets is hundreds and thousands of times more comfortable than life on earth, the heavenly 
planets are not pure [nirmalam], or free from the taint of material existence. The heavenly planets are also temporary, and therefore they are not the goal of life. The Supreme Personality of Godhead, however, has never been seen or heard to possess inebr
iety. Consequently, for your own benefit and self-realization, you must worship the Lord with great devotion, as described in the revealed scriptures.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 As stated in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 k\'f1\'e9\'ebe pu\'ebye martya-loka\'e0 vi\'e7anti.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  Even if one is promoted to the highe
r planetary systems by performing great sacrifices, which are accompanied by the sinful act of sacrificing animals, the standard of happiness in Svargaloka is also not free of disturbances. There is a similar struggle for existence even for the King of he
aven, Indra. Thus there is no practical benefit in promoting oneself to the heavenly planets. Indeed, from the heavenly planets one must return to this earth after one has exhausted the results of his pious activities. In the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vedas}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  it is said, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tad yatheha karma jito loka\'f9 k\'f1\'e9yate evam ev\'e4mutra pu\'ebya jito loka\'f9 k\'f1\'e9yata.}{
\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  As the material positions we acquire here by hard work are vanquished in due course of time, one's residence in the heavenly planets is also eventually vanquished. According to one's activitie
s of piety in different degrees, one obtains different standards of life, but none of them are permanent, and therefore they are all impure. Consequently, one should not endeavor to be promoted to the higher planetary systems, only to return to this earth
 or descend still lower to the hellish planets. To stop this cycle of going up and coming down, one must take to K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu therefore said:
\par }\pard\plain \s1434\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahm\'e4\'eb\'f2a bhramite kona bh\'e4gyav\'e4n j\'e9va\line guru-k\'e5\'f1\'eba-pras\'e4
de p\'e4ya bhakti-lat\'e4-b\'e9ja\line }{\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid10582019 (Cc.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs2542\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Madhya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid10582019 19.151)}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 

\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
The living entity is rotating in the cycle of birth and death, going sometimes to the higher planets and sometimes to the lower planets, but that is not the solution to the problems of life. But if by the grace of K\'e5\'f1\'eba one is fortunate en
ough to meet a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 guru,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  a representative of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, one gets the clue to returning home, back to Godhead, having achieved self-realization. This is what is actually desirable. }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhajat\'e4tma-labdhaye:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  one must take to K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness for self-realization.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.7.41
