\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tad-vij\'ef\'e4n\'e4rtha\'e0 sa gurum ev\'e4bhigacchet:}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  to solve the problems of life, one must accept a spiritual master. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Tasm\'e4d guru
\'e0 prapadyeta jij\'ef\'e4su\'f9 \'e7reya uttamam:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 if one is actually serious in inquiring about the solution to material existence, one must approach a bona fide }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 guru.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tad viddhi pra\'ebip\'e4tena\line paripra\'e7nena sevay\'e4\line upadek\'f1yanti te j\'ef
