 religion, which we accept should be that which is recommended by Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja}{\insrsid11874437 \emdash }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bh\'e4gavata-dharma.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  This is the instruction of K\'e5
