\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  refers to this material world. This is confirmed by Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba in His instruction in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  th
at this material world is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 du\'f9kh\'e4layam,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  full of material conditions. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vi}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  means }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vi\'e7e\'f1a,}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  "specifically," and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 n\'e9ta}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756 
 means "brought in." By the mercy of the Supreme Lord, Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja was especially brought to this material world to teach people how to get out of the material condition. Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yad\'e4
 yad\'e4 hi dharmasya gl\'e4nir bhavati bh\'e4rata.}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  When the entire population, or part of it, becomes forgetful of its own duty, K\'e5\'f1\'eba comes. When K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a is not present the devotee is present, but the mission is the same: to free the poor conditioned souls from the clutches of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 m\'e4y\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid14425756  that chastises them.
