\par }\pard\plain \s1140\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\cf9\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e7r\'e9-brahm\'e4 uv\'e4ca}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash Lord Brahm\'e4
 said; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 nata\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash bowed down; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 asmi}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash I am; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 anant\'e4ya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the unlimited Lord; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 duranta}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash very difficult to find an end to; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e7aktaye}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash who possesses different potencies; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vicitra-v\'e9ry\'e4ya}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash having varieties of prowess; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 pavitra-karma\'ebe}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
whose actions have no reaction (even though doing contrary things, He remains without contamination by the material modes); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vi\'e7vasya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of the universe; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sarga}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash creation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sthiti}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash maintenance; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sa\'e0yam\'e4n}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash and annihilation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 gu\'ebai\'f9}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by the material qualities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sva-l\'e9lay\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash very easily; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sandadhate}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash performs; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 
avyaya-\'e4tmane}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash whose personality never deteriorates.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf9\insrsid30033 Lord Brahm\'e4 prayed:}{\fs28\insrsid30033 
 My Lord, You are unlimited, and You possess unending potencies. No one can estimate or calculate Your prowess and
 wonderful influence, for Your actions are never polluted by the material energy. Through the material qualities, You very easily create the universe, maintain it and again annihilate it, yet You remain the same, without deterioration. I therefore offer m
y respectful obeisances unto You.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
The activities of the Lord are always wonderful. His personal servants Jaya and Vijaya were confidential friends, yet they were cursed, and they accepted bodies of demons. Again, in the family of one such demon, Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja was caused to take birth to exhibit the behavior of an exalted devotee, and then the Lord accepted the body of }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid10038355 N\'e5si\'e0hadeva}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 to kill that same demon, who by the Lord's own will had taken birth in a demoniac family. Therefore, who can understan
d the Lord's transcendental activities? Not to speak of understanding the transcendental activities of the Lord, no one can understand even the activities of His servants. In }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Caitanya-carit\'e4m\'e5ta}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Madhya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  23.39) it is said, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 t\'e4\'ecra v\'e4kya, kriy\'e4, mudr\'e4 vij\'efeha n\'e4 bhujhaya:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 no one can understand the activities of the Lord's servants. Therefore, what to speak of the activities of the Lord? Who can understand how K\'e5\'f1\'eba is benefiting the entire world? The Lord is addressed as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 duranta-
\'e7akti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  because no one can understand His potencies and how He acts.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.8.41
