iva offered his prayer; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 kopa-k\'e4la\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the right time for Your anger (for the purpose of annihilating the universe); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yuga-anta\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
the end of the millennium; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 te}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by You; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 hata\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash killed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ayam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash this; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 asura\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash great demon; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 alpaka\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash very insignificant; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tat-sutam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash his son (Prahl\'e4
da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 p\'e4hi}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash just protect; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 upas\'e5tam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash who is surrendered and standing nearby; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhaktam}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash devotee; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 te}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of Your Lordship; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhakta-vatsala}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash O my Lord, who are so affectionate to Your devotee.
