}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash shares in the sacrifices; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 daitya-\'e4kr\'e4ntam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash afflicted by the demon; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 h\'e5daya-kamalam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
