{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash accepts; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yat yat}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash whatever; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 jana\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash a person; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhagavate}{\fs28\insrsid30033 
\emdash unto the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vidadh\'e9ta}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash may offer; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 m\'e4nam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash worship; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tat}{
