}{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 na}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash not; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ca}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash and; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 udvijanta\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash who are afraid (of Your fearful appearance); }{
