k why the living entity is put into the material world. Indeed, sometimes foolish people deride the Lord for having put them here. Actually, everyone is put into conditional life according to his }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 karma.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Therefore Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, representing all the other conditioned souls, admits that he was put into life among the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 asuras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  because of the results of his }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 karma.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 The}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Lord is known as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 k\'e5pa\'eba-vatsala}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 because He is extremely kind to the conditioned souls. As stated in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  therefore, the Lord appears whenever there are discrepancies in the execution of religious principles (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yad\'e4 yad\'e4 hi dharmasya gl\'e4nir bhavati bh\'e4rata.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 .. tad\'e4tm\'e4na\'e0 s\'e5j\'e4my aham}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
). The Lord is extremely anxious to deliver the conditioned souls, and therefore He instructs all of us to return home, back to Godhead (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sarva-dharm\'e4n parityajya m\'e4m eka\'e0 \'e7ara\'eba\'e0 vraja}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). Thus Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja expected that the Lord, by His kindness, would call him again to the shelter of His lotus feet. In other words, everyone should be eager to return home, ba
ck to Godhead, taking shelter of the lotus feet of the Lord and thus being fully trained in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.9.17
