\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 O my Lord }{\fs28\insrsid10038355 N\'e5si\'e0hadeva}{\fs28\insrsid30033 
, by engaging in Your transcendental loving service in the association of devotees who are liberated souls [ha\'e0
sas], I shall become completely uncontaminated by the association of the three modes of material nature and be able to chant the glories of Your Lordship, who are so dear to me. I shall chant Your glories, following exactly in the footsteps of Lord Brahm
\'e4 and his disciplic succession. In this way I shall undoubtedly be able to cross the ocean of nescience.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
A devotee's life and duty are very well explained herein. As soon as a devotee can chant the holy name and glories of the Supreme 
Lord, he certainly comes to the liberated position. Attachment for glorifying the Lord by hearing and chanting the holy name and activities of the Lord (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtana\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ) certainly brings one to the position where material contamination is absent. One should chant the bona fide songs received from the disciplic succession. In }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  it is said that the chanting is powerful when one follows the disciplic succession (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 eva\'e0 parampar\'e4-pr\'e4ptam ima\'e0 r\'e4jar\'f1ayo vidu\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
). Manufacturing many ways of chanting will never be effective. However, chanting the song or the narration left by the previous }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4c\'e4ryas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mah\'e4
jano yena gata\'f9 sa panth\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ) is extremely effective, and this process is very easy. Therefore in this verse Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja uses the word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 a\'efja\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 ("ea
sily"). Accepting the thoughts of exalted authorities through disciplic succession is certainly much easier than the method of mental speculation, by which one tries to invent some means to understand the Absolute Truth. The best process is to accept the 
instructions of the previous }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4c\'e4ryas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 and follow them. Then God realization and self-realization become extremely easy. By following this easy method, one is liberated from the contamination of the material modes of nature, and thus one can certainly cross t
he ocean of nescience, in which there are many miserable conditions. By following in the footsteps of the great }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4c\'e4ryas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  one associates with the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ha\'e0sas}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 paramaha\'e0sas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  those who are completely freed from material contamination. Indeed, by following the instructions of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4c\'e4ryas
}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 one is always freed from all material contamination, and thus one's life becomes successful, for one reaches the goal of life. This material world is miserable, regardless of one's standard of life. Of this there is no doubt. Atte
mpts to mitigate the miseries of material existence by material methods will never be successful. One must take to K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness to become really happy; otherwise happiness is impossible. One might say that becoming advanced in spiritual life also involves }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tapasya,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 voluntary acceptance of some inconvenience. However, such inconvenience is not as dangerous as material attempts to mitigate all miseries.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.9.19
