My dear Lord, everyone in this material world is under the modes of material nature, being influenced by goodness, passion and ignorance. Everyone\emdash from the greatest personality, Lord Brahm\'e4, down to the small ant\emdash 
works under the influence of these modes. Therefore everyone in this material world is influenced by Your energy. The cause for which they work, the pl
ace where they work, the time when they work, the matter due to which they work, the goal of life they have considered final, and the process for obtaining this goal\emdash 
all are nothing but manifestations of Your energy. Indeed, since the energy and energetic are identical, all of them are but manifestations of You.
