\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  The Supreme Personality of Godhead, the Supersoul within the core of everyone's heart, gives inspirations for action according to one's mentality. All of these mentalities are merely facilities given by K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a to the person acting. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  therefore says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 matta\'f9 sm\'e5tir j\'ef\'e4nam apohana\'e0 ca:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  everyone
