e
rms of the knowledge-gathering senses, the working senses, the mind and the five material elements. The wheel of repeated birth and death is created by the Supreme Personality of Godhead, but to direct the bewildered living entity in progress toward liber
ation according to varied stages of advancement, different directions are given in the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vedas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 chandomayam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
