}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 guru,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or representative of God, he receives the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakti-lat\'e4-b\'e9ja,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  the seed of devotional service. If he properly cultivates K\'e5
\'f1\'eba consciousness, he is then gradually elevated to the spiritual world. The ultimate conclusion is that one must surrender to the principles of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakti-yoga,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 for then one will gradually attain liberation. No other method of liberation from the material struggle is at all possible.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.9.22
