that one (the supreme independent person who, through His external energy, has created the material mind, which is the cause of all suffering in this material world); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tvam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash You (are); }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 hi}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 nitya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash eternally; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vijita-\'e4tma}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash conquered; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 gu\'eba\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash whose property of the intelligence; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sva-dh\'e4mn\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by Your personal spiritual energy; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 k\'e4la\'f9
}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the time element (which creates and annihilates); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 va\'e7\'e9-k\'e5ta}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash brought under Your control; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vis\'e5jya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
by which all effects; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 visarga}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash and causes; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e7akti\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the energy; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 cakre}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
in the wheel of time (the repetition of birth and death); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vis\'e5\'f1\'f6am}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash being thrown; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ajay\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
by Your external energy, the mode of ignorance; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e9\'e7vara}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash O supreme controller; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'f1o\'f2a\'e7a-are}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash with sixteen spokes
 (the five material elements, the ten senses, and the leader of the senses, namely the mind); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ni\'f1p\'e9\'f2yam\'e4nam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash being crushed (under that wheel); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 upakar\'f1a}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash kindly take me (to the shelter of Your lotus feet); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vibho}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash O supreme great; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 prapannam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash who am fully surrend
ered unto You.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 
My dear Lord, O supreme great, You have created this material world of sixteen constituents, but You are transcendental to their material qualities. In other words, these material qualities are under Your full control, and You ar
e never conquered by them. Therefore the time element is Your representation. My Lord, O Supreme, no one can conquer You. As for me, however, I am being crushed by the wheel of time, and therefore I surrender fully unto You. Now kindly take me under the p
rotection of Your lotus feet.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
The wheel of material miseries is also a creation of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, but He is not under the control of the material energy. Rather, He is the controller of the material energy, whereas we, the livin
g entities, are under its control. When we give up our constitutional position (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 j\'e9vera 'svar\'fcpa' haya-k\'e5\'f1\'ebera 'nitya-d\'e4sa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
'), the Supreme Personality of Godhead creates this material energy and her influence over the conditioned soul. Therefore He is the Supreme, and only He can deliver the conditioned soul from the onslaught of material nature (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 m\'e4m eva ye prapadyante m\'e4y\'e4m et\'e4\'e0 taranti te}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 M\'e4y\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 the external energy, continuously imposes upon the conditioned souls the suffering of the threefold miseries of this material world. Therefore, in the previous verse, Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja prayed to the Lord, "But for Your Lordship, no one can save me." Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja has also explained that a child's protectors, his parents, cannot save the child from the onslaught 
of birth and death, nor can medicine and a physician save one from death, nor can a boat or similar means of protection save a person drowning in the water, for everything is controlled by the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Therefore suffering humanity m
ust surrender to K\'e5\'f1\'eba, as K\'e5\'f1\'eba Himself demands in the last instruction of }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (18.66):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sarva-dharm\'e4n parityajya\line m\'e4m eka\'e0 \'e7ara\'eba\'e0 vraja\line aha\'e0 tv\'e4
\'e0 sarva-p\'e4pebhyo\line mok\'f1ayi\'f1y\'e4mi m\'e4 \'e7uca\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "Abandon all varieties of religion and just surrender unto Me. 
I shall deliver you from all sinful reaction. Do not fear." All of human society must take advantage of this offer and thus be saved by K\'e5\'f1\'eba from the danger of being crushed by the wheel of time, the wheel of past, present and future.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ni\'f1p\'e9\'f2yam\'e4nam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 ("being crushed") is very significant. Every living entity in the material condition is actually being crushed again and again, and to be saved from this position one must take shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Then one will be happy. The w
ord }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 prapannam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 is also very significant, for unless one fully surrenders to the Supreme Lord one cannot be saved from being crushed. A criminal is put in prison and punished by the government, but the same government, if it likes, can release the criminal f
rom imprisoned life. Similarly, we must know conclusively that our material condition of suffering has been allotted to us by the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and if we want to be saved from this suffering, we must appeal to the same controller. Thus o
ne can be saved from this material condition.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.9.23
