haloka (which offers fruits according to the desire of the devotee); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 te}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash Your; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 pras\'e4da\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash benediction or blessing; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sev\'e4-anur\'fcpam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash according to the category of service one renders to the Lord; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 udaya\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash manifestation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 na}{
