because of bad association or increased association with material desires; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 k\'e5tv\'e4 \'e4tmas\'e4t}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash causing me (to acquire spiritual qualities like himself, \'c7r\'e9 N\'e4rada); }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sura-\'e5\'f1i\'eb\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by the great saintly person (N\'e4rada); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhagavan}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash O my Lord; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 g\'e5h\'e9ta\'f9}{
