\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 nu}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vis\'e5je}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash can give up; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tava}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash Your; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bh\'e5
