\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vilaya-ambu-madhye}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash in the Causal Ocean, in which everything is preserved in a state of reserved energy; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e7e\'f1e}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash You act as if sleeping; }{
