experiencing the state of spiritual bliss; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 nir\'e9ha\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash appearing to be doing nothing; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yogena}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by the mystic power; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 m\'e9lita-d\'e5k}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the eyes appearing closed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4tma}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by a manifestation of Yourself; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 nip\'e9ta}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash prevented; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 nidra\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash whose sleeping; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 turye}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash in the transcendental stage; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sthita\'f9
