\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 aha\'e0 sarvasya prabhavo matta\'f9 sarva\'e0 pravartate}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
). Thus the Supreme Lord extends everywhere, even throughout our bodies, because our bodies are made of material energy, which is the Lord's separated energy. One should realize that since the Supreme Lo
rd spreads throughout one's body and since the individual soul is a part of the Supreme Lord, everything is Brahman (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sarva\'e0 khalv ida\'e0 brahma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). This realization was achieved by Lord Brahm
\'e4 after he was purified, and it is possible for everyone. When one is completely in knowledge of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 aha\'e0 brahm\'e4smi,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
