\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 d\'e5\'f1\'f6v\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash seeing; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mah\'e4-puru\'f1am}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4pa}{\fs28\insrsid30033 
