va, with the head of a horse, You killed two demons known as Madhu and Kai\'f6abha, who were full of the modes of passion and ignorance. Then You delivered the Vedic knowledge to Lord Brahm\'e4
. For this reason, all the great saints accept Your forms as transcendental, untinged by material qualities.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 The Supreme Perso
nality of Godhead in His transcendental form is always ready to give protection to His devotees. As mentioned herein, the Lord in the form of Hayagr\'e9va killed two demons named Madhu and Kai\'f6abha when they attacked Lord Brahm\'e4
. Modern demons think that there was no life in the beginning of creation, but from }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 we understand that the first living creature created by the Supreme Personality of Godhead was Lord Brahm\'e4, who is full of Vedic understanding. Unfortunately, those entrusted with distr
ibuting Vedic knowledge, such as the devotees engaged in spreading K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness, may sometimes be attacked by demons, but they must rest assured that demoniac attacks will not be able to harm them, for the Lord is always prepared to give them protection. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vedas}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  provide the knowledge by which we can understand the Supreme Personality of Godhead (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vedai\'e7 ca sarvair aham eva vedya\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
). The devotees of the Lord are always ready to spread knowledge by which one may understand the Lord through K\'e5\'f1\'eba consci
ousness, but the demons, being unable to understand the Supreme Lord, are full of ignorance and passion. Thus the Lord, whose form is transcendental, is always ready to kill the demons. By culturing the mode of goodness, one can understand the position of
 the transcendental Lord and how the Lord is always prepared to remove all obstacles on the path of understanding Him.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
