\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "Whenever and wherever there is a decline in religious practice, O descendant of Bh\'e4
rata, and a predominant rise of irreligion\emdash at that time I descend Myself." It is simpl
y foolish to think of the Lord as being originally impersonal but accepting a material body when He appears as a personal incarnation. Whenever the Lord appears, He appears in His original transcendental form, which is spiritual and blissful. But unintell
igent men, such as the M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9s, cannot understand the transcendental form of the Lord, and therefore the Lord chastises them by saying, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 avaj\'e4nanti m\'e4\'e0 m\'fc\'f2h\'e4 m\'e4nu\'f1\'e9\'e0 tanum \'e4
\'e7ritam:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "Fools deride Me when I descend in the human form." Whenever the Lord appea
rs, whether as a fish, a tortoise, a hog or any other form, one should understand that He maintains His transcendental position and that His only business, as stated here, is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 hatv\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \emdash 
to kill the demons. The Lord appears in order to protect the devotees and kill the demons (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 paritr\'e4\'eb\'e4ya s\'e4dh\'fcn\'e4\'e0 vin\'e4\'e7\'e4ya ca du\'f1k\'e5t\'e4m}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
). Since the demons are always ready to oppose Vedic civilization, they are sure to be killed by the transcendental form of the Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.9.38
