akhila-guro}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash O supreme spiritual master of the entire creation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhagavan}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash O Supreme Lord, O Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 pray\'e4sa\'f9}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash endeavor; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 utt\'e4ra\'ebe}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash for the deliverance of these fallen souls; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 asya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of this; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 
bhava-sambhava}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of creation and maintenance; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 lopa}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash and of annihilation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 heto\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of the cause; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 m\'fc\'f2he\'f1u}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the foolish persons rotting in this material world; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vai}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mahat-anugraha\'f9}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash compassion by the Supreme; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4rta-bandho}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash O friend of the suffering living entities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 kim}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
what is the difficulty; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tena}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash with that; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 te}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of Your Lordship; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 priya-jan\'e4n}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
the dear persons (devotees); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 anusevat\'e4m}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of those always engaged in serving; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 na\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash like us (who are so engaged).
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 
O my Lord, O Supreme Personality of Godhead, original spiritual master of the entire world, what is the 
difficulty for You, who manage the affairs of the universe, in delivering the fallen souls engaged in Your devotional service? You are the friend of all suffering humanity, and for great personalities it is necessary to show mercy to the foolish. Therefor
e I think that You will show Your causeless mercy to persons like us, who engage in Your service.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Here the words }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 priya jan\'e4n anusevat\'e4\'e0 na\'f9}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  indicate that the Supreme Lord, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, is very favorable to devotees who act acc
ording to the instructions of His own pure devotee. In other words, one must become the servant of the servant of the servant of the Lord. If one wants to become the servant of the Lord directly, this is not as fruitful as engaging in the service of the L
ord's servant. This is the direction of \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu, who shows us the way to become }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 gop\'e9-bhartu\'f9 pada-kamalayor d\'e4sa-d\'e4s\'e4nud\'e4sa\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 One should not be proud of becoming directly the servant of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Rather, one must se
ek a pure devotee, a servant of the Lord, and engage oneself in the service of such a servant. The more one becomes the servant of the servant, the more one becomes perfect in devotional service. This is also the injunction of }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 eva\'e0 parampar\'e4-pr\'e4ptam ima\'e0 r\'e4jar\'f1ayo vidu\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 One can understand the science of the Supreme Personality of Godhead simply by the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 parampar\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  system. In this regard, \'c7r\'e9la Narottama d\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kura says, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 t\'e4\'ecdera cara\'eba sevi bhakta-sane v\'e4sa:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  "Let me serve the lotus feet of the devotees of the Lord, and let me live with devotees." }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
Janame janame haya, ei abhil\'e4\'f1a.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Following Narottama d\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kura, one should aspire to be a servant of the Lord's servant, life after life. \'c7r\'e9la Bhaktivinoda \'d6h\'e4kura also sings, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tumi ta' \'f6h\'e4kura, tom\'e4ra kukura, baliy\'e4 j\'e4naha more:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  "O my Lord, O Vai\'f1\'ebava, please consider me your dog." One must become the dog of a Vai\'f1\'eb
ava, a pure devotee, for a pure devotee can deliver K\'e5\'f1\'eba without difficulty. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 K\'e5\'f1\'eba se tom\'e4ra, k\'e5\'f1\'eba dite p\'e4ra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the property of
 His pure devotee, and if we take shelter of a pure devotee, he can deliver K\'e5\'f1\'eba very easily. Prahl\'e4da wants to engage in the service of a devotee, and therefore he prays to K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, "My dear Lord, kindly give me the shelter of Your very dear devotee so that I may engage in his service and You may then be pleased." }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Mad-bhakta-p\'fcj\'e4bhyadhik\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{
\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid5139582\charrsid5139582 (Bh\'e4g.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  11.19.21). The Lord says, "Engaging in the service of My devotee is better than trying to engage in My devotional service."
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Another significant point in this verse is that by devotional service Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja does not want to benefit alone. Rather, he prays to the Lord that all of us fallen souls in this material world may, by the grace of the Lord, engage in the service of His servant and thus be delivered. The g
race of the Lord is not at all difficult for the Lord to bestow, and thus Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja wants to save the whole world by spreading K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.9.43
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 TEXT 43
\par }\pard\plain \s1168\qr \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 TEXT
