Ta*PYaiNTa Naeh k*-Pa<aa bhudu"%>aaJa"\line  k-<@UiTavNMaNaiSaJa& ivzheTa Daqr" )) 45 ))
\par }\pard\plain \s23\qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 yan maithun\'e4di-g\'e5hamedhi-sukha\'e0 hi tuccha\'e0
