\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ime}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash these two; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sat-asat\'e9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the cause and the effect; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tava}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash Your; }{
