\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 iva}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash like; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 na}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash never; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ca}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash also; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 anyat}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash any other; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ar\'fcpakasya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of You, who possess no material form; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yukt\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
those engaged in Your devotional service; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 samak\'f1am}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash before the very eyes; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ubhayatra}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash in both ways (spiritually and materially); }{
