simply by the method of devotional service; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vahnim}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash fire; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 iva}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash like; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 d\'e4ru\'f1u}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
in wood; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 na}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash not; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 anyata\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash from any other means; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sy\'e4t}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash it is possible.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 
By authorized Vedic knowledge one can see that the forms of cause and effect in the cosmic manifestation belong to the Supreme Personality of Godhead, for the cosmic man
ifestation is His energy. Both cause and effect are nothing but energies of the Lord. Therefore, O my Lord, just as a wise man, by considering cause and effect, can see how fire pervades wood, those engaged in devotional service understand how You are bot
h the cause and effect.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
As described in previous verses, many so-called students of spiritual understanding follow the ten different methods known as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mauna-vrata-\'e7ruta-tapo-'dhyayana-sva-dhar}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid5994578 ma-vy\'e4khy
\'e4-raho japa-sam\'e4dhaya\'f9}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 .}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  These may be very attractive, but by following such methods, one cannot actually understand the real cause and effect and the original cause of everything (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 janm\'e4dy asya yata\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). The original source of everything is the Supreme Personality of Godhead Himself (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sarva-k\'e4ra\'eba-k\'e4ra\'ebam}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). This original source of everything is K\'e5\'f1\'eba, the supreme ruler. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c9\'e7vara\'f9 parama\'f9}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid5994578  k\'e5\'f1\'eba\'f9 sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha\'f9}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 .}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  He has His eternal spiritual form. Indeed, He is the root of everything (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid5994578 b\'e9ja\'e0 m\'e4\'e0 sarva-bh\'fct\'e4n\'e4m}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
