\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakty\'e4 m\'e4m abhij\'e4n\'e4ti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). Elsewhere in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{
