desiring to exhibit the symptoms of a pure devotee; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhaktam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the devotee; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 k\'e4me\'f1u}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash in the material world, where lusty desires predomi
nate; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 acodayat}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash has sent; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhav\'e4n}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash Your Lordship; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sa\'e0s\'e4ra-b\'e9je\'f1u}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
the root cause of being present in this material world; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 h\'e5daya-granthi\'f1u}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash which (desire for material enjoyment) is in the cores of the hearts of all conditioned souls; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 prabho}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash O my worshipable Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 
O my worshipable Lord, because the seed of lusty desires, which is the root cause of material existence, is within the core of everyone's heart, You have sent me to this material world to exhibit the symptoms of a pure devotee.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhakti-ras\'e4m\'e5ta-sindhu}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 has given considerable discussion about }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nitya-siddha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 s\'e4dhana-siddha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  devotees. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Nitya-siddha}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  devotees come from Vaiku\'eb\'f6ha to this material world to teach, by their personal example, how to become a devotee. The living entities in this material world can take lessons from such }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
nitya-siddha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  devotees and thus become inclined to return home, back to Godhead. A }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nitya-siddha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  devotee comes from Vaiku\'eb\'f6
ha upon the order of the Supreme Personality of Godhead and shows by his example how to become a pure devotee (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid674708 any\'e4bhil\'e4\'f1it\'e4-\'e7\'fcnyam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
). In spite of coming to this material world, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nitya-siddha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  devotee is never attracted by the allurements of material enjoyment. A perfect example is Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, who was a }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nitya-siddha,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mah\'e4-bh\'e4gavata}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  devotee. Although Prahl\'e4da was born in the family of Hira\'ebyaka\'e7
ipu, an atheist, he was never attached to any kind of materialistic enjoyment. Desiring to exhibit the symptoms of a pure devotee, the Lord tried to induce Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja to take material benedictions, but Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja did not accept them. On the contrary, by his personal example he showed the symptoms of a pure devotee. In other words, the Lord Himself has no desire to send His pure devotee to this material world, nor does a devotee have any 
material purpose in coming. When the Lord Himself appears as an incarnation within this material world, He is not allured by the material atmosphere, and He has nothing to do with material activity, yet by His example He teaches the common man how to beco
me a devotee. Similarly, a devotee who comes here in accordance with the order of the Supreme Lord shows by his personal behavior how to become a pure devotee. A pure devotee, therefore, is a practical example for all living entities, including Lord Brahm
\'e4.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.10.4
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 TEXT 4
