\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mana\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the mind; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 pr\'e4\'eba\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the life air; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4tm\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the body; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 dharma\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash religion; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 dh\'e5ti\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash patience; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mati\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash intelligence; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 hr\'e9\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash shyness; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e7r\'e9\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash opulence; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 teja\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash strength; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sm\'e5ti\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash memory; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 satyam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash truthfulness; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yasya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of which lusty desires; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 na\'e7yanti}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash are vanquished; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 janman\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash from the very beginning of birth.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 O my Lord, because of lusty desires from the very beginning of one's birth, the fun
ctions of one's senses, mind, life, body, religion, patience, intelligence, shyness, opulence, strength, memory and truthfulness are vanquished.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 As stated in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam, k\'e4ma\'e0 h\'e5
d-rogam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Materialistic life means that one is afflicted by a fo
rmidable disease called lusty desire. Liberation means freedom from lusty desires because it is only due to such desires that one must accept repeated birth and death. As long as one's lusty desires are unfulfilled, one must take birth after birth to fulf
i
ll them. Because of material desires, therefore, one performs various types of activities and receives various types of bodies with which to try to fulfill desires that are never satisfied. The only remedy is to take to devotional service, which begins wh
en one is free from all material desires. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10491820 Any\'e4bhil\'e4\'f1it\'e4-\'e7\'fcnyam}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 .}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Anya-abhil\'e4\'f1it\'e4}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  means "material desire," and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'fcnyam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  means "free from." The spiritual soul has spiritual activities and spiritual desires, as described by \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4
prabhu: }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mama janmani janman\'e9\'e7vare bhavat\'e4d bhaktir ahaituk\'e9 tvayi.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 Unalloyed devotion to the service of the Lord is the only spiritual desire. To fulfill this spiritual desire, however, one must be free from all material desires. Desirelessness means freedom from material desires. This is described by \'c7r\'e9la R\'fc
pa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid10491820 any\'e4bhil\'e4\'f1it\'e4-\'e7\'fcnyam}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 .}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 As soon as one has material desires, one loses his spiritual identity. Then all the paraphernalia of one's life, including one's senses, body, religion, patience and intelligence, are deviated from one's original K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness. As soon as one has material desires, one cannot properly use his senses, intelligence, mind and so on for the satisfaction of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9 philosophers want to become impersonal
, senseless and mindless, but that is not possible. The living entity must be living, always existing with desires, ambitions and so on. These should be purified, however, so that one can desire spiritually and be spiritually ambitious, without material c
ontamination. In every living entity these propensities exist because he is a living entity. When materially contaminated, however, one is put into the hands of material misery (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 janma-m\'e5tyu jar\'e4-vy\'e4dhi}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). If one wants to stop repeated birth and death, one must take to the devotional service of the Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sarvop\'e4dhi-vinirmukta\'e0\line tat-paratvena nirmalam\line h\'e5\'f1\'e9ke\'eba h\'e5
\'f1\'e9ke\'e7a-\line sevana\'e0 bhaktir ucyate}{\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
"Bhakti, or devotional service, means engaging all our senses in the service of the Lord, the Supreme Personality of God
head, the master of all the senses. When the spirit soul renders service unto the Supreme, there are two side effects. One is freed from all material designations, and, simply by being employed in the service of the Lord, one's senses are purified."

\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.10.9
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 TEXT 9
