 of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 nama\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash I offer my respectful obeisances; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhagavate}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the Supreme Person; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tubhyam}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto You; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 puru\'f1\'e4ya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the Supreme Person; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mah\'e4-\'e4tmane}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the Supreme Soul, or the Supersoul; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 haraye}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the Lord, who vanquishes all the miseries of devotees; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 adbhuta-si\'e0h\'e4ya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto Your wonderful lionlike form as }{
\fs28\insrsid10038355 N\'e5si\'e0hadeva}{\fs28\insrsid30033 ; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 brahma\'ebe}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the Supreme Brahman; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 parama-\'e4tmane}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash unto the Supreme Soul.

\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
