\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is meant for the less intelligent man. Narottama d\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kura says in his }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid7415407 P}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 rema-bhakti-candrik\'e4
