\'f2a}{\fs28\insrsid7415407 \emdash }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 fruitive activities and speculation about the Supreme Lord\emdash are like pots of poison. One who is attracted to }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
