\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 eva\'e0 prahl\'e4dasy\'e4\'e0\'e7ena s\'e4dhana-siddhatva\'e0 nitya-siddhatva\'e0 ca n\'e4rad\'e4divaj j\'efeyam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  There are two classes of devotees\emdash the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 s\'e4
dhana-siddha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nitya-siddha.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja is a mixed }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 siddha;}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  that is, he is perfe
ct partly because of executing devotional service and partly because of eternal perfection. Thus he is compared to such devotees as N\'e4rada. Formerly, N\'e4rada Muni was the son of a maidservant, and therefore in his next birth he attained perfection (}
{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 s\'e4dhana-siddhi}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ) because of having executed devotional service. Yet he is also a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nitya-siddha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 because he never forgets the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3007\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033\charrsid11471083 The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ku\'e7alena}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is very important. One should live in the material world very expertly. The material world i
s known as the world of duality because one sometimes has to act impiously and sometimes has to act piously. Although one does not want to act impiously, the world is so fashioned that there is always danger (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 pada\'e0
 pada\'e0 yad vipad\'e4m}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). Thus even when performing devotional service a devotee has to create many enemies. Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja himself had experience of this, for even his father became his enemy. A devotee should expertly manage to think always of the Supreme Lord so that the reactions of suffering cannot touch him. This is the expert management of }{
