n the authentic scriptures (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'e4stras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ), and therefore before one risks accepting a pretender as an }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 avat\'e4ra,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
