\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid12528238 brahma\'ebo hi prati\'f1\'f6h\'e4ham}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 , matta\'f9 paratara\'e0 n\'e4nyat.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  "The impersonal Brahman is My partial manifestation, and the
