\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 urukrama-\'e4tmana\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of he (Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja) whose mind is always engaged upon the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who always acts uncommonly; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yudhi\'f1\'f6
hira\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash King Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 daitya-pate\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of the master of the demons; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mud\'e4-anvita\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
in a pleasing mood; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 papraccha}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash inquired; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bh\'fcya\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash again; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tanayam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
unto the son; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 svayambhuva\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of Lord Brahm\'e4.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
