 After hearing about the activities and character of Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, which are adored and discussed among great personalities like Lord Brahm\'e4 and Lord \'c7iva, Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja, the most respectful king among exalted personalities, again inquired from the great saint N\'e4rada Muni in a mood of great pleasure.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.11.2
