\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash and; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ty\'e4ga\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash giving in charity at least fifty percent of one's income; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sv\'e4dhy\'e4ya\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
