\'e4rata}{\fs28\insrsid30033  (or, for those not in Vedic culture, reading of the Bible or Koran); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4rjavam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash simplicity (freedom from mental duplicity); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 santo\'f1a
\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash being satisfied with that which is available without severe endeavor; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 samad\'e5k-sev\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash rendering service to saintly persons who make no distinct
ions between one living being and another and who see every living being as a spirit soul (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 pa\'eb\'f2it\'e4\'f9 sama-dar\'e7ina\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 ); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 gr\'e4mya-\'e9ha-uparama\'f9}{
