being grave and silent; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4tma}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash into the self; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vimar\'e7anam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash research (as to whether one is the body or the soul); }{
