rava\'ebam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash hearing; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 k\'e9rtanam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash chanting; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ca}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash also; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 asya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 
\emdash of Him (the Lord); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 smara\'ebam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash remembering (His words and activities); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 mahat\'e4m}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash of great saintly persons; }{
