\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 avanati\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash offering obeisances; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 d\'e4syam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash accepting the service; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sakhyam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
