\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  population. In modern terms, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eba-sa\'eckara}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  are the hippies, who do not follow any regulative injunctions. Another explanation is that when the population is }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eba-sa\'eckara,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  no one can know who is on what platform. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  system scientifically divides society into four }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and four }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4\'e7ramas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  but in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eba-sa\'eckara}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 society there are no such distinctions, and no one can know who is who. In such a society, no one can distinguish between a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 k\'f1atriya,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vai\'e7ya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'fcdra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  For peace and happiness in the material world, the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  institution must be introduced. The symptoms of one's activities must be defined, and one must be educated accordingly. Then spiritual advancement will automatically be possible.

