\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 
A chaste woman should not be greedy, but satisfied in all circumstances. She must be very expert in handling household affairs and should be fully conversant with religious principles. She should speak pleasingly and tru
thfully and should be very careful and always clean and pure. Thus a chaste woman should engage with affection in the service of a husband who is not fallen.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 According to the injunction of Y\'e4j\'efavalkya, an authority on religious principles, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4\'e7uddhe\'f9 sampratik\'f1yo hi mah\'e4p\'e4taka-d\'fc\'f1ita\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 One is considered contaminated by the reactions of great sinful activities when one has not been purified according to the methods of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 da\'e7a-vidh\'e4-sa\'e0sk\'e4ra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  In }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  however, the Lord says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 na m\'e4\'e0 du\'f1k\'e5tino m\'fc\'f2h\'e4\'f9 prapadyante nar\'e4dham\'e4\'f9:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "Those miscreants who do not surrender unto Me are the lowest of mankind." The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nar\'e4dhama}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  means "nondevotee." \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu also said, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yei bhaje sei ba\'f2a, abhakta-h\'e9na, ch\'e4ra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Anyone who is a devotee is sinless. 
One who is not a devotee, however, is the most fallen and condemned. It is recommended, therefore, that a chaste wife not associate with a fallen husband. A fallen husband is one who is addicted to the four principles of sinful activity\emdash 
namely illicit sex,
 meat-eating, gambling and intoxication. Specifically, if one is not a soul surrendered to the Supreme Personality of Godhead, he is understood to be contaminated. Thus a chaste woman is advised not to agree to serve such a husband. It is not that a chast
e woman should be like a slave while her husband is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 nar\'e4dhama,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 the lowest of men. Although the duties of a woman are different from those of a man, a chaste woman is not meant to serve a fallen husband. If her husband is fallen, it is recommended that she g
ive up his association. Giving up the association of her husband does not mean, however, that a woman should marry again and thus indulge in prostitution. If a chaste woman unfortunately marries a husband who is fallen, she should live separately from him
. Similarly, a husband can separate himself from a woman who is not chaste according to the description of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'e4stra.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  The conclusion is that a husband should be a pure Vai\'f1\'eb
ava and that a woman should be a chaste wife with all the symptoms described in this regard. Then both of them will be happy and make spiritual progress in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.11.29
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 TEXT 29
