\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Brahma-sa\'e0hit\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (5.29) says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 lak\'f1m\'e9-sahasra-\'e7ata-sambhrama-sevyam\'e4nam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  In the Vaiku\'eb\'f6ha planets, Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u is worshiped by many, many thousands of goddesses of fortune, and in Goloka V\'e5nd\'e4vana, Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba is worshiped by many, many thousands of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 gop\'e9s,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 all of whom are goddesses of fortune. A woman should serve her husband as faithfully as the goddess of fortune. A man should be an ideal servant of the Lord, and a woman should
 be an ideal wife like the goddess of fortune. Then both husband and wife will be so faithful and strong that by acting together they will return home, back to Godhead, without a doubt. In this regard, \'c7r\'e9la Madhv\'e4c\'e4rya gives this opinion:

\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 harir asmin sthita iti\line str\'e9\'eb\'e4\'e0 bhartari bh\'e4van\'e4\line \'e7i\'f1y\'e4
\'eb\'e4\'e0 ca gurau nitya\'e0\line \'e7\'fcdr\'e4\'eb\'e4\'e0 br\'e4hma\'eb\'e4di\'f1u\line bh\'e5ty\'e4n\'e4\'e0 sv\'e4mini tath\'e4\line hari-bh\'e4va ud\'e9rita\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
A woman should think of her husband as the Supreme Lord. Similarly, a disciple should think of the spiritual master as the Supreme Personality of Godhead, a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'fcdra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  should think of a }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 as the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and a servant should think of his master as the Supreme Personality of Godhead. In this way, all of them will automatically become devotees of the Lord. In othe
r words, by thinking this way, all of them will become K\'e5\'f1\'eba conscious.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.11.30
