 If a woman of a high caste marries a man of a lower caste, their union is called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4743731 pratilo}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 .}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
