 "It is far better to discharge one's prescribed duties, even though they may be faulty, than another's duties." The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 antyajas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 the men of the lower classes, are accustomed to stealing, drinking and illicit
 sex, but that is not considered sinful. For example, if a tiger kills a man, this is not sinful but if a man kills another man, this is considered sinful, and the killer is hanged. What is a daily affair among the animals is a sinful act in human society
