 Unless one is qualified in terms of the brahminical symptoms, one cannot take }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4sa.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  In designating a person a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'eba, k\'f1atriya, vai\'e7ya}{
