 Only one who executes his spiritual life under the direction of the spiritual master can achieve the mercy of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Yas}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid13242621 ya pras\'e4d\'e4d bhagavat-pras\'e4da\'f9}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 .}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  If one desires to advance in spiritual life but he acts whimsically, not following the orders of the spiritual master, he has no shelter. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Yasy\'e4pras\'e4d\'e4
