\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vai\'e7yas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \emdash must learn the Vedic literatures according to their capability and power to understand. In other words, studying the Vedic literatures is compulsory for everyone but the }{
