ledge has nothing to do with understanding of the Absolute Truth. Technology, therefore, is meant for the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'fcdras,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  whereas the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vedas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
