\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  the overseer, and who orders material nature to fulfill the various desires of the living being. As clearly stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (18.61):
