alabdha-nidr\'e4\'eb\'e4m}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash who are suffering from insomnia; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 sarvata\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash from all sides; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 abhivi\'e7a\'eckin\'e4m}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
