a consciousness movement we need so many things, and K\'e5\'f1\'eba is therefore supplying us the requisite money to advance this mission. The mission of K\'e5\'f1\'eba is to spread K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness all over the world, and for this purpose we naturally must have sufficient money. Therefore, according to the advice of \'c7r\'e9la R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 Prabhup\'e4da, we should not give up attachment to money that can spread the K\'e5
\'f1\'eba consciousness movement. \'c7r\'e9la R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 says in his }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhakti-ras\'e4m\'e5ta-sindhu}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (1.2.256):
