\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'ebas, k\'f1atriyas, vai\'e7yas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'fcdras,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 and the members of this society would limit their endeavors to meeting their minimum demands. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'ebas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  in particular, would have no material desires. Because the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 k\'f1atriyas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  had to rule the people, it was necessary for them to have money and prestige. But the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vai\'e7yas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
