I started temples and Deity worship. The same principle should still be followed. Whatever money is collected should be spent for K\'e5\'f1\'eba, and not a farthing for sense gratification. This is the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bh\'e4gavata}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  principle.
