Different people are of different mentalities. Therefore it is not my business either to praise them or to blaspheme them. I only desire their welfare, hoping that they will agree to become one with the Supersoul, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, K\'e5
\'f1\'eba.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 As soon as one comes to the platform of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 bhakti-yoga,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  one understands fully the Supreme Personality of Godhead, V\'e4sudeva, is the goal of life (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 v\'e4sudeva\'f9 sarvam iti sa mah\'e4tm\'e4 sudurlabha\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
). This is the instruction of all the Vedic literature (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vedai\'e7 ca sarvair aham eva vedya\'f9, sarva dharm\'e4n parityajya m\'e4m eka\'e0 \'e7ara\'eba\'e0 vraja}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ). There is no use 
in praising someone for material qualifications or blaspheming him for material disqualifications. In the material world, good and bad have no meaning because if one is good he may be elevated to a higher planetary system and if one is bad he may be degra
ded to the lower planetary systems. People of different mentalities are sometimes elevated and sometimes degraded, but this is not the goal of life. Rather, the goal of life is to become free from elevation and degradation and take to K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness. Therefore a saintly person does not discriminate between that which is supposedly good and supposedly bad; rather, he desires for everyone to be happy in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, which is the ultimate goal of life.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.13.43
