f Brahman." Thus a devotee's position is secure. A devotee is at once elevated to the spiritual platform. Others, such as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ha\'f6ha-yog\'e9s,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  can only gradually ascend to the spiritual platform by nullifying their material discrimination on the platfor
m of psychology and nullifying the false ego, by which one thinks, "I am this body, a product of matter." One must merge the false ego into the total material energy and merge the total material energy into the supreme energetic. This is the process of be
coming free from material attraction.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.13.44
