\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4\'e7ramas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  or statuses of life, are extremely important for fulfillment of the goal of life. One should note that in the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahmac\'e4r\'e9-\'e4\'e7rama, v\'e4
