\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'e4stras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 guru.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira Mah\'e4r\'e4ja could understand all this. Therefore, as a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5
