d extra money only for the K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hasthas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
