\par }\pard\plain \s1140\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb120\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\cf9\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tri-vargam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
three principles, namely religiosity, economic development and sense gratification; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 na}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash not; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ati-k\'e5cchre\'eba}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by very severe endeavor; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 bhajeta}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash should execute; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 g\'e5ha-medh\'e9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash a person interested only in family life; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 api}{\fs28\insrsid30033 
\emdash although; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yath\'e4-de\'e7am}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash according to the place; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yath\'e4-k\'e4lam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash according to the time; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 y\'e4vat
}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash as much as; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 daiva}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by the grace of the Lord; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 upap\'e4ditam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash obtained.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 Even if one is a householder rather than a brahmac\'e4r\'e9, a sanny\'e4s\'e9 or a v
\'e4naprastha, one should not endeavor very hard for religiosity, economic development or satisfaction of the senses. Even in householder life, one should be satisfied to maintain body and soul together 
with whatever is available with minimum endeavor, according to place and time, by the grace of the Lord. One should not engage oneself in ugra-karma.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 In human life there are four principles to be fulfilled-}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
dharma, artha, k\'e4ma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mok\'f1a}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  (religion, e
conomic development, sense gratification, and liberation). First one should be religious, observing various rules and regulations, and then one must earn some money for maintenance of his family and the satisfaction of his senses. The most important cerem
ony for sense gratification is marriage because sexual intercourse is one of the principal necessities of the material body. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Yan maithun\'e4di-g\'e5hamedhi-sukha\'e0 hi tuccham.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 Although sexual intercourse is not a very exalted requisite in life, both animals and me
n require some sense gratification because of material propensities. One should be satisfied with married life and not expend energy for extra sense gratification or sex life.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 As for economic development, the responsibility for this should be entrusted mainly to the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vai\'e7yas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hasthas.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Human society should be divided into }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and 
}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e4\'e7ramas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid3027246 \emdash }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma\'eba, k\'f1atriya, vai\'e7ya, \'e7\'fcdra, brahmacarya, g\'e5hastha, v\'e4naprastha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4sa.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Economic development is necessary for }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hasthas.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Br\'e4hma\'eba g\'e5hasthas}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  should be satisfied with a life of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 adhyayana, adhy\'e4pana, yajana}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 y\'e4jana}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \emdash 
being learned scholars, teaching others to be scholars, learning how to worship the Supreme Personality of Godhead, Vi\'f1\'ebu, and also teaching others how to worship Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, or even the demigods. A }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 br\'e4hma
\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  should do this without remuneration, but he is allowed to accept charity from a person whom he teaches how to be a human being. As for the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 k\'f1atriyas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 they are supposed to be the kings of the land, and the land should be distributed to the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 vai\'e7yas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  for agricultural activities, cow protection and trade. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c7
\'fcdras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  must work; sometimes they should engage in occupational duties as cloth manufacturers, weavers, blacksmiths, goldsmiths, brass-smiths, and so on, or else they should engage in hard labor to produce food grains.
\par These are the different occupational duties by which men should earn their livelihood, and in this way human society should be simple. At the present moment, however, everyone is engaged in technological advancement, which is described in }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ugra-karma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \emdash extremely severe endeavor. This }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 ugra-karma}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is the cause of agitation within the human mind. Men are engaging in many sinful activities and becoming degraded by opening slaughterhouses, breweries and cigarette factories, as w
ell as nightclubs and other establishments for sense enjoyment. In this way they are spoiling their lives. In all of these activities, of course, householders are involved, and therefore it is advised here, with the use of the word }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 api,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  that even though one is a householder, one should not engage himself in severe hardships. One's means of livelihood should be extremely simple. As for those who are not }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hasthas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \emdash the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahmac\'e4r\'e9s, v\'e4naprasthas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4s\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
\emdash they don't have to do anything but strive for advancement in spiritual life. This means that three fourths of the entire population should stop sense gratification and simply be engaged in the advancement of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness. Only one fourth of the population should be }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hastha,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and that should be according to laws of restricted sense gratification. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5
hasthas, v\'e4naprasthas, brahmac\'e4r\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4s\'e9s}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  should endeavor together with their total energy to become K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a conscious. This type of civilization is called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 daiva-var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  One of the objectives of the K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement is to establish this }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 daiva-var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  but not to encourage so-called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  without scientifically organized endeavor by human society.

\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.14.11
