{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash should divide; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yath\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash as much as (deserved); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 api}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash even; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ek\'e4m}{
\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash one; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4tmana\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash own; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 d\'e4r\'e4m}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the wife; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 n\'e5\'eb\'e4m}{\fs28\insrsid30033 
\emdash of the people in general; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 svatva-graha\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the wife is accepted as being identical with one's self; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yata\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash because of which.

\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
