one who (the Supreme Personality of Godhead); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tena}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by him; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 hi}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 ajita\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
cannot be conquered; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 jita\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash conquered.
