r
y much under the control of the devotee. And if the Lord is pleased with a devotee, what is there that is unobtainable? Why should one not give up his affection for his wife and children and take shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead? Where is the
 loss of anything material? Householder life means attachment for one's wife, whereas }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4sa}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  means detachment from one's wife and attachment to K\'e5\'f1\'eba.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.14.13
