people use a certain type of oil preparation. Oil, however, is never recommended for offering in a sacrificial fire. In Kali-yuga, the available quantity of food grains and ghee is gradually diminishing, and people are embarrassed that they cannot produce
 sufficient ghee and food grains. Under the circumstances, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'e4stras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  enjoin, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yaj\'efai\'f9 sa\'eck\'e9rtana-pr\'e4yair yajanti hi sumedhasa\'f9:}{
