rtana}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  movement, or Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba movement, we offer sumptuous }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 pras\'e4da}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  to the Deity and later distribute the same }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 pras\'e4da}{
