 ceremony of oblations to the forefathers should not be performed on Ek\'e4da\'e7\'e9 }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tithi.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  When the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tithi}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  of th
e death anniversary falls on the Ek\'e4da\'e7\'e9 day, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7r\'e4ddha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  ceremony should be held not on Ek\'e4da\'e7\'e9 but on the next day, or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dv\'e4da\'e7\'e9.
