\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'e7\'e4stra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and the example set by Advaita \'c4c\'e4rya, we give }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 pras\'e4da}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
