all such activities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 niyama-codan\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the regulative principles further meant for controlling the senses and mind; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 tat-ant\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
the ultimate goal of such activities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yadi}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash if; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 no}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash not; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 yog\'e4n}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
the positive link with the Supreme; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e4vaheyu\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash did lead to; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 \'e7rama-\'e4vah\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash a waste of time and labor.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 
Ritualistic ceremonies, regulative principles, austerities and the practice of yoga are all meant to control the senses and mind, but even after one is able to control the senses and mind, if he does n
ot come to the point of meditation upon the Supreme Lord, all such activities are simply labor in frustration.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 One may argue that one may achieve the ultimate goal of life\emdash 
realization of the Supersoul\emdash by practicing the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  system and ritualistic p
erformances according to the Vedic principles, even without staunch devotion to the spiritual master. The actual fact, however, is that by practicing }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 one must come to the platform of meditating upon the Supreme Personality of Godhead. As stated in the scriptures, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dhy\'e4n\'e4vasthita-tad-gatena manas\'e4 pa\'e7yanti ya\'e0 yogina\'f9:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }
{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 a person in meditation achieves the perfection of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 practice when he can see the Supreme Personality of Godhead. By various practices, one may come to the point of controlling the sense
s, but simply controlling the senses does not bring one to a substantial conclusion. However, by staunch faith in the spiritual master and the Supreme Personality of Godhead, one not only controls the senses but also realizes the Supreme Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yasya deve par\'e4 bhaktir\line yath\'e4 deve tath\'e4 gurau\line tasyaite kathit\'e4
 hy arth\'e4\'f9\line prak\'e4\'e7ante mah\'e4tmana\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
"Only unto those great souls who have implicit faith in both the Lord and the spiritual master are all the imports of the Vedic knowledge automatically revealed." (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'c7vet\'e4\'e7vatara Upani\'f1ad}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  6.23) It is further stated, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tu\'f1yeya\'e0 sarva-bh\'fct\'e4tm\'e4 guru-\'e7u\'e7r\'fc\'f1ay\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 taranty a\'efjo bhav\'e4r\'ebavam.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Simply by rendering service to the spiritual master, one crosses the ocean of nescience and returns home, back to Godhead. Thus he gradually sees
 the Supreme Lord face to face and enjoys life in association with the Lord. The ultimate goal of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 is to come in contact with the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Unless this point is achieved, one's so-called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yoga}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  practice is simply labor without any benefit.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.15.29
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 TEXT 29
\par }\pard\plain \s1168\qr \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 TEXT
