\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 yog\'e9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  searching for the Supreme Lord within the core of his heart (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 dhy\'e4n\'e4vasthita-tad-gatena manas\'e4 pa\'e7yanti ya\'e0 yogina\'f9}{
