\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mah\'e4-mantra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  there are no particular injunctions regarding one's sitting place. The injunction }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 niyamita\'f9 smara\'ebe na k\'e4la\'f9}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  includes }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 de\'e7a, k\'e4la}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 p\'e4tra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \emdash 
place, time and the individual. Therefore anyone may chant the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 mantra,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  without consideration of the time and place. Especially in this age, Kali-yuga, it is very diffi
