 have been described herein as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 apatrapa\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 asattam\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \emdash shameless and fallen from spiritual life.
