rama to give up the regulative principles, for a brahmac\'e4r\'e9 not to follow the brahmac\'e4r\'e9 vows while living under the care of the guru, for a v\'e4naprastha to live in the village and engage in so-called social activities, or for a sanny\'e4s
\'e9 to be addicted to sense gratification. One who acts in this way is to be considered the lowest renegade. Such a pretender is bewil
dered by the external energy of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and one should either reject him from any position, or taking compassion upon him, teach him, if possible, to resume his original position.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 We have repeatedly stressed that human c
ulture does not begin unless one takes to the principles of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama-dharma.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  Although }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 g\'e5hastha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 life is a concession for the enjoyment of sex, one cannot enjoy sex without following the rules and regulations of householder life. Furthermore, as already instructed, a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahmac\'e4r\'e9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 must live under the care of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 guru:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahmac\'e4r\'e9 guru-kule vasan d\'e4nto guror hitam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  If a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
brahmac\'e4r\'e9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  does not live under the care of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 guru,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  if a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 v\'e4naprastha}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 engages in ordinary activities, or if a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4s\'e9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  is greedy and
 eats meat, eggs and all kinds of nonsense for the satisfaction of his tongue, he is a cheater and should immediately be rejected as unimportant. Such persons should be shown compassion, and if one has sufficient strength one should teach them to stop the
m from following the wrong path in life. Otherwise one should reject them and pay them no attention.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.15.40
