\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 cet}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash if; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 vij\'e4n\'e9y\'e4t}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash can understand; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 param}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
who are transcendental, beyond this material world; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 j\'ef\'e4na}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by knowledge; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 dhuta-\'e4\'e7aya\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash one who has 
cleansed his consciousness; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 kim}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash what; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 icchan}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash desiring material comforts; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 kasya}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash 
for whom; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 v\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash or; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 heto\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash for what reason; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 deham}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash the material body; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 pu\'f1\'eb\'e4ti}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash he maintains; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 lampa\'f6a\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash being unlawfully addicted to sense gratification.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 The human form of b
ody is meant for understanding the self and the Supreme Self, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, both of whom are transcendentally situated. If both of them can be understood when one is purified by advanced knowledge, for what reason and for whom does a
 foolish, greedy person maintain the body for sense gratification?
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
Of course, everyone in this material world is interested in maintaining the body for sense gratification, but by cultivating knowledge one should gradually understand that the body i
s not the self. Both the soul and the Supersoul are transcendental to the material world. This is to be understood in the human form of life, especially when one takes }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4sa.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  A }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4s\'e9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  one who has understood the self, should be engaged in elevating the self and associating with the Superself. Our K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement is meant for elevating the living being for promotion back home, back to Godhead. Seeking such elevation is one's duty in the human form of life. Unless one performs this duty, why should one maintain the body? Especially if a }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4s\'e9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  not only maintains the body by ordinary means but does everything to maintain the body, including even eating meat and other abominable things, he must be a }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 lampa\'f6a\'f9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  a greedy person simply engaged in sense gratification. A }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 sanny\'e4s\'e9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 must specifically remove himself from the urges of the tongue, belly and genitals, which disturb one as long as one is not fully aware that the body is separate from the soul.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.15.41
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid30033 TEXT 41
