 conceptions of life are sometimes polluted by passion and ignorance, which are exhibited by attachment, hostility, greed, lamentation, illusion, fear, madness, false prestige, insults, fault-finding, deception, envy, intolerance, passion, bewilderment, h
unger and sleep. All of these are enemies. Sometimes one's conceptions are also polluted by goodness.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid30033 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
The actual aim of life is to go back home, back to Godhead, but there are many hindrances created by the three modes of material nature\emdash sometimes by a combination of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 rajo-gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tamo-gu\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 the modes of passion and ignorance, and sometimes by the mode of goodness. In the material world, even if one is a philanthropist, a nationalist and a good man according to materialistic estimations, these concep
tions of life form a hindrance to spiritual advancement. How much more of a hindrance, then, are hostility, greed, illusion, lamentation and too much attachment to material enjoyment? To progress toward the target of Vi\'f1\'eb
u, which is our real self-interest, one must become very powerful in conquering these various hindrances or enemies. In other words, one should not be attached to being a good man or a bad man in this material world.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi369\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 In this material world, so-called goodness and badness are the same becaus
e they consist of the three modes of material nature. One must transcend this material nature. Even the Vedic ritualistic ceremonies consist of the three modes of material nature. Therefore K\'e5\'f1\'eba advised Arjuna:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 traigu\'ebya-vi\'f1ay\'e4 ved\'e4\line nistraigu\'ebyo bhav\'e4rjuna\line 
nirdvandvo nitya-sattva-stho\line niryoga-k\'f1ema \'e4tmav\'e4n
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 "The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Vedas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 mainly deal with the subject of the three modes of material nature. Rise above these modes, O Arjuna. Be transcendental to all of them. Be free from all dualities and from all anxieties for ga
in and safety, and be established in the self." (Bg. 2.45) Elsewhere in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  the Lord says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 \'fcrdhva\'e0 gacchanti sattva-sth\'e4\'f9:}{
\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 if one becomes a very good person\emdash in other words, if one is in the mode of goodness\emdash he may be elevated to the higher planetary systems. Similarly, if one is infected by }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 rajo-gu\'eba}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 tamo-gu\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 he may remain in this world or go down to the animal kingdom. But all of these situations are hindrances on the path of spiritual salvation. \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu therefore says:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 brahm\'e4\'eb\'f2a bhramite kona bh\'e4gyav\'e4n j\'e9va\line guru-k\'e5\'f1\'eba-pras\'e4
de p\'e4ya bhakti-lat\'e4-b\'e9ja}{\cs1998\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  }{\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
If one is fortunate enough to transcend all this so-called goodness and badness and come to the platform of devotional service by the mercy of K\'e5\'f1\'eba and the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 guru,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 
 his life becomes successful. In this regard, one must be very bold so that he can conquer these enemies of K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. Not caring for the good and bad of this material world, one must boldly propagate K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness.

\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid30033 SB 7.15.45
