\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 j\'ef\'e4na-d\'e9pe\'f1u}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash by enlightenment in real knowledge; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 juhvati}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash offers.
