 "My dear mind, under the influence of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 m\'e4y\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033  you are being carried away by the waves of rejection and acceptance. Simply take shelter of K\'e5\'f1\'eba." }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid30033 J
