\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 durgha\'f6atv\'e4t}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash because of being very difficult to prove the reality; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid30033 aindriyakam}{\fs28\insrsid30033 \emdash knowledge derived from the senses; }{
