r annihilated. When all in this world is annihilated, that part remains as it is. That supreme abode is called unmanifested and infallible, and it is the supreme destination. When one goes there, he never comes back. That is My supreme abode." The materia
l world is a reflection of the spiritual world. The material world is temporary or false, but the spiritual world is an eternal reality.
